(2367599, 328434, 51638, '<td valign="top">For these to really work, the composition needs to be a little more interesting than just placing the moon centrally and the moon needs to be sharply in focus.</td>', 'For these to really work, the composition needs to be a little more interesting than just placing the moon centrally and the moon needs to be sharply in focus.', '2006-05-01 08:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367600, 328082, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and focus.</td>', 'Nice colours and focus.', '2006-05-01 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367603, 327510, 18219, '<td valign="top">the quality is good-it''s in focus, clear and crisp etc.<br/>But there is nothing "special" about the picture.<br/>there is no story here.<br/>Maybe if the background include something that could us more about this person?<br/>like his job or where he lives or what he is doing there?<br/>as it is, it looks like a picture used for a work magazine employee of the month :-)<br/>nice expression though.</td>', 'the quality is good-it''s in focus, clear and crisp etc.But there is nothing "special" about the picture.there is no story here.Maybe if the background include something that could us more about this person?like his job or where he lives or what he is doing there?as it is, it looks like a picture used for a work magazine employee of the month :-)nice expression though.', '2006-05-01 08:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367605, 328176, 51638, '<td valign="top">Needs a little sharper focus on the vase IMO.</td>', 'Needs a little sharper focus on the vase IMO.', '2006-05-01 08:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367607, 327615, 51638, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple. Nice.</td>', 'Clean and simple. Nice.', '2006-05-01 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367613, 328269, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and composition. I''d really like to have seen his eyes, but clearly there''s nothing you could do about that.</td>', 'Nice capture and composition. I''d really like to have seen his eyes, but clearly there''s nothing you could do about that.', '2006-05-01 08:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367615, 327572, 18219, '<td valign="top">i like the sense of movement, but I can''t tell what it is.<br/>rollerblades?<br/>scooter perhaps?<br/>not that it matters too much.<br/>but it would help with the overall picture telling a story, because at the moment it''s not really saying too much except something is going round a corner.</td>', 'i like the sense of movement, but I can''t tell what it is.rollerblades?scooter perhaps?not that it matters too much.but it would help with the overall picture telling a story, because at the moment it''s not really saying too much except something is going round a corner.', '2006-05-01 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367617, 328017, 51638, '<td valign="top">Um....interesting.</td>', 'Um....interesting.', '2006-05-01 08:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367620, 328254, 18219, '<td valign="top">maybe the canoeist (?) is a little too centered for my liking.<br/>using some rule of thirds and giving him soething to be floating in to would have given it more impact.</td>', 'maybe the canoeist (?) is a little too centered for my liking.using some rule of thirds and giving him soething to be floating in to would have given it more impact.', '2006-05-01 08:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367621, 327930, 18219, '<td valign="top">good capture, i''m just not too keen on the close crop.<br/>i would have liked to have seen more of what he was looking toward and more of the great texture of that wall.</td>', 'good capture, i''m just not too keen on the close crop.i would have liked to have seen more of what he was looking toward and more of the great texture of that wall.', '2006-05-01 08:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367623, 328453, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea -  a woman bearing the cross could be a nice stock-photo shot for an article about many things in our society.  This should generate some thought on the parts of many DPC members. Look-out... I''m about to get critical :) ...  As far as the photo being a photo (rather than simply an idea) ... The POV and lighting here are average.  There is not much drama other than the idea itself.  The background is distracting and I think I might have tried to lay on the ground and shoot it upward to a point were I might be able to clone out the trees.   Assuming it is a reference to Jesus, I think she needs to show more suffering to be fair -- Perhaps looking away from the camera - maybe up to the heavens might make it appear more thoughtful (or you could argue that she is look at "us")  but I''m speaking strictly from an interesting photo standpoint.    In conclusion ... (sorry to be long-winded), the model is beautiful and the image is striking ... Just too bad the sun wasn''t more dramatic and the composition and POV were a little stronger. 6</td>', 'I like the idea -  a woman bearing the cross could be a nice stock-photo shot for an article about many things in our society.  This should generate some thought on the parts of many DPC members. Look-out... I''m about to get critical :) ...  As far as the photo being a photo (rather than simply an idea) ... The POV and lighting here are average.  There is not much drama other than the idea itself.  The background is distracting and I think I might have tried to lay on the ground and shoot it upward to a point were I might be able to clone out the trees.   Assuming it is a reference to Jesus, I think she needs to show more suffering to be fair -- Perhaps looking away from the camera - maybe up to the heavens might make it appear more thoughtful (or you could argue that she is look at "us")  but I''m speaking strictly from an interesting photo standpoint.    In conclusion ... (sorry to be long-winded), the model is beautiful and the image is striking ... Just too bad the sun wasn''t more dramatic and the composition and POV were a little stronger. 6', '2006-05-01 08:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
