(2367729, 327444, 51638, '<td valign="top">As the focal point (pardon the pun) is the knife blade, I''d like to see a little more light on that. Also, I can''t say I care for the subject matter, but that''s a personal taste thing, so I wouldn''t vote you down for that.</td>', 'As the focal point (pardon the pun) is the knife blade, I''d like to see a little more light on that. Also, I can''t say I care for the subject matter, but that''s a personal taste thing, so I wouldn''t vote you down for that.', '2006-05-01 09:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
