(2368586, 327615, 54843, '<td valign="top">Was this a studio shot or natural and unscripted?  I really like it regardless.  Great color, great composition, and great focus.  a favorite for me!</td>', 'Was this a studio shot or natural and unscripted?  I really like it regardless.  Great color, great composition, and great focus.  a favorite for me!', '2006-05-01 13:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
