(2368799, 328453, 5015, '<td valign="top">Very Weird... her outfit is outrageous.  What were you trying to say?</td>', 'Very Weird... her outfit is outrageous.  What were you trying to say?', '2006-05-01 15:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368861, 327788, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a striking photo!   It grabs you the minute you look at it, and evokes deep emotion.   Ilove the dark sepia look.  It just adds to the overall mood of the photo!  Excellent photography!!!!!!  10</td>', 'What a striking photo!   It grabs you the minute you look at it, and evokes deep emotion.   Ilove the dark sepia look.  It just adds to the overall mood of the photo!  Excellent photography!!!!!!  10', '2006-05-01 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368865, 327965, 24454, '<td valign="top">And WHAT a DELIGHT this photo is!!!!!  The moment you see this, you get lost in the wonderful, soothing tones of this amazing photo!  I hope this ribbons.  It so deserves it!!!!  10</td>', 'And WHAT a DELIGHT this photo is!!!!!  The moment you see this, you get lost in the wonderful, soothing tones of this amazing photo!  I hope this ribbons.  It so deserves it!!!!  10', '2006-05-01 15:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368867, 328519, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, PERFECT skyline photo!  No blown out lights.  No blur!  Congratulations.  This is absolutely stunning!    10</td>', 'This is a beautiful, PERFECT skyline photo!  No blown out lights.  No blur!  Congratulations.  This is absolutely stunning!    10', '2006-05-01 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368871, 327894, 24454, '<td valign="top">A prize winning photo if ever I saw one!  It is PERFECT!  10</td>', 'A prize winning photo if ever I saw one!  It is PERFECT!  10', '2006-05-01 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368891, 327915, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible image. Love everything about it.</td>', 'This is an incredible image. Love everything about it.', '2006-05-01 15:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368898, 328485, 37103, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great and fun scene to photograph, but it seems like there is too much going on and too many people crammed together her to be able to focus on any one thing.</td>', 'This looks like a great and fun scene to photograph, but it seems like there is too much going on and too many people crammed together her to be able to focus on any one thing.', '2006-05-01 15:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368899, 328185, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blue.</td>', 'I like the motion blue.', '2006-05-01 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368901, 328463, 30049, '<td valign="top">I noticed last week, driving thru town, that they''ve really cleaned up the front of that building.  I think it''s that one anyway.  Stopped and ate at Pancho Villa''s while we were in town.  ;^)  I like the way the late day sun reflects off the State sign - nice composition the way you''ve framed this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I noticed last week, driving thru town, that they''ve really cleaned up the front of that building.  I think it''s that one anyway.  Stopped and ate at Pancho Villa''s while we were in town.  ;^)  I like the way the late day sun reflects off the State sign - nice composition the way you''ve framed this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-01 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368902, 327999, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very cute animals, I would have liked to see you move closer in and get more detail on them or back up and get a feel for the countryside around them.</td>', 'Very cute animals, I would have liked to see you move closer in and get more detail on them or back up and get a feel for the countryside around them.', '2006-05-01 15:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368905, 328396, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is a little blurry, would have been a unique entry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Too bad this is a little blurry, would have been a unique entry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-01 15:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368908, 328453, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well exposed image in a unique setting.  Feels a bit sacrilegious to me.</td>', 'Well exposed image in a unique setting.  Feels a bit sacrilegious to me.', '2006-05-01 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368914, 328542, 37103, '<td valign="top">This photo looks very yellow/green on my monitor.  You may want to go back and color balance.  Cute couple and nice pose, the print on his shirt is a little distracting.</td>', 'This photo looks very yellow/green on my monitor.  You may want to go back and color balance.  Cute couple and nice pose, the print on his shirt is a little distracting.', '2006-05-01 15:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368915, 327822, 37103, '<td valign="top">The shadows on his face and really nice in bringing out the shape and colors.</td>', 'The shadows on his face and really nice in bringing out the shape and colors.', '2006-05-01 15:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368918, 327867, 37103, '<td valign="top">This guy looks familiar.  Were you at the Renaissance fair?  Nice image, but the colors look all very gray.  It might be nice to have a little more contrast and lighten the image a little.</td>', 'This guy looks familiar.  Were you at the Renaissance fair?  Nice image, but the colors look all very gray.  It might be nice to have a little more contrast and lighten the image a little.', '2006-05-01 15:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368919, 327615, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very crisp bright image.  Are those ladybugs real?  They somehow look fake.  Anyway, nice shot.</td>', 'Very crisp bright image.  Are those ladybugs real?  They somehow look fake.  Anyway, nice shot.', '2006-05-01 15:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368920, 328492, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, it seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, it seems slightly out of focus.', '2006-05-01 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369008, 327867, 22046, '<td valign="top">Weird looking guy. I really like the way you photographed him.</td>', 'Weird looking guy. I really like the way you photographed him.', '2006-05-01 16:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369015, 327774, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of his eye and side of his face. I find the out of focus fingers a bit confusing. I think they take away from the quality of this photograph.</td>', 'I really like the look of his eye and side of his face. I find the out of focus fingers a bit confusing. I think they take away from the quality of this photograph.', '2006-05-01 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369018, 327774, 48115, '<td valign="top">beautiful! nice lighting</td>', 'beautiful! nice lighting', '2006-05-01 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2369022, 328134, 22046, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors in this photo.</td>', 'Lovely colors in this photo.', '2006-05-01 16:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369029, 328286, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever idea to tip your setup so the wine is at an angle. I think it would be more powerful without the balls at the bottom. The image would have a stronger graphic impact.</td>', 'Clever idea to tip your setup so the wine is at an angle. I think it would be more powerful without the balls at the bottom. The image would have a stronger graphic impact.', '2006-05-01 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369033, 328125, 48115, '<td valign="top">just lovely.. very well done.. the red dress makes this for me</td>', 'just lovely.. very well done.. the red dress makes this for me', '2006-05-01 16:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369034, 328326, 22046, '<td valign="top">Sweet expression on her face.</td>', 'Sweet expression on her face.', '2006-05-01 16:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369036, 328543, 48115, '<td valign="top">Mývatn? nee.. probably not.. but iceland it is..</td>', 'Mývatn? nee.. probably not.. but iceland it is..', '2006-05-01 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369085, 328176, 22551, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  It is nice and simple yet the colors stand out.</td>', 'I like this one.  It is nice and simple yet the colors stand out.', '2006-05-01 16:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369092, 327444, 22551, '<td valign="top">Very nice image from a photographic perspective (sharp where you want it,ect).  The concept looks a little too staged.  It seems a bit shortsighted to place your victim''s hands so close to the torture instruments.  Also I don''t get a real sense of threat.</td>', 'Very nice image from a photographic perspective (sharp where you want it,ect).  The concept looks a little too staged.  It seems a bit shortsighted to place your victim''s hands so close to the torture instruments.  Also I don''t get a real sense of threat.', '2006-05-01 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369095, 328002, 37103, '<td valign="top">Since you could use advanced editing for this challenge I might have made the background on the left black or white to get rid of the distracting stuff on the garage wall.  Otherwise awesome shot and beautiful reflections in the metal of the car.  I also like the composition with the car split down the middle.</td>', 'Since you could use advanced editing for this challenge I might have made the background on the left black or white to get rid of the distracting stuff on the garage wall.  Otherwise awesome shot and beautiful reflections in the metal of the car.  I also like the composition with the car split down the middle.', '2006-05-01 16:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369097, 328463, 22551, '<td valign="top">I would have taken this photo at a different time of day.  Do not get enough of the rust and decay.</td>', 'I would have taken this photo at a different time of day.  Do not get enough of the rust and decay.', '2006-05-01 16:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369102, 327842, 22551, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in the back.  Don''t know what time the pic was taken (I''m guessing either early/mid morning or evening) but a little more sun light may have allowed the colors to come out a bit more.</td>', 'I really like the colors in the back.  Don''t know what time the pic was taken (I''m guessing either early/mid morning or evening) but a little more sun light may have allowed the colors to come out a bit more.', '2006-05-01 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369104, 328149, 22551, '<td valign="top">Truth be told looks a little more like falling but fun shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Truth be told looks a little more like falling but fun shot nonetheless.', '2006-05-01 16:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369130, 328343, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks un-naturally blue, a problem with either your white balance or in your post processing.</td>', 'This looks un-naturally blue, a problem with either your white balance or in your post processing.', '2006-05-01 17:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369163, 328017, 12802, '<td valign="top">WOW, such a great photograph here!!  Really like this one!  This is the first shot I''ve opened, hope they aren''t all as good as this :-)<br/> <br/>This is one of those shots that just grabs a persons attention, there''s so many things to look at here we just have to take time looking over it.<br/> <br/>Firstly, what a great idea!!  I could understand just doing her face, but as I can see it the coloured balls are all over her top half too, so much has gone into it...<br/> <br/>Her pupils are so large, something else to look at in the shot.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would pass comment on is the white space on the right.  It''s great that there is space there, maybe just a little too much for my liking.  But, that''s not going to effect the score.<br/> <br/>A full 10 points here, couldn''t give it any less :-)  Well Done!</td>', 'WOW, such a great photograph here!!  Really like this one!  This is the first shot I''ve opened, hope they aren''t all as good as this :-) This is one of those shots that just grabs a persons attention, there''s so many things to look at here we just have to take time looking over it. Firstly, what a great idea!!  I could understand just doing her face, but as I can see it the coloured balls are all over her top half too, so much has gone into it... Her pupils are so large, something else to look at in the shot. The only thing I would pass comment on is the white space on the right.  It''s great that there is space there, maybe just a little too much for my liking.  But, that''s not going to effect the score. A full 10 points here, couldn''t give it any less :-)  Well Done!', '2006-05-01 17:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369170, 328006, 42132, '<td valign="top">this is just superb.favourite.</td>', 'this is just superb.favourite.', '2006-05-01 17:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369349, 328394, 55025, '<td valign="top">Brgggggggggggggggggggggggggg</td>', 'Brgggggggggggggggggggggggggg', '2006-05-01 18:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369377, 328386, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh pretty! What an interesting "almost-abstract"! Lovely close up, perfect composition, great use of shallow DOF. I wish the main area of focus were a touch sharper though.</td>', 'Oooh pretty! What an interesting "almost-abstract"! Lovely close up, perfect composition, great use of shallow DOF. I wish the main area of focus were a touch sharper though.', '2006-05-01 18:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369384, 328542, 3087, '<td valign="top">Erm. That''s an extremely strong yellow colour cast. I''m sure you''ve had other comments about it... The portrait itself is sweet, the expressions are natural.   Lighting is a touch harsh and highlights slightly sweaty or oily faces. Colour cast could have been resolved by changing white balance settings on shooting, or correction in conversion if shooting in RAW, or in post processing if shooting in JPEG.</td>', 'Erm. That''s an extremely strong yellow colour cast. I''m sure you''ve had other comments about it... The portrait itself is sweet, the expressions are natural.   Lighting is a touch harsh and highlights slightly sweaty or oily faces. Colour cast could have been resolved by changing white balance settings on shooting, or correction in conversion if shooting in RAW, or in post processing if shooting in JPEG.', '2006-05-01 18:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369386, 327720, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is great --- Love it!</td>', 'This is great --- Love it!', '2006-05-01 18:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369388, 327863, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting portrait! I really like the blue toning - works very well. I''m not sure about the pose - it doesn''t convey dancing as much as a lady simply about to turn about to speak to two people behind her. I think perhaps that''s because we can only see their top halves. But I do like the details of their outfits.</td>', 'What an interesting portrait! I really like the blue toning - works very well. I''m not sure about the pose - it doesn''t convey dancing as much as a lady simply about to turn about to speak to two people behind her. I think perhaps that''s because we can only see their top halves. But I do like the details of their outfits.', '2006-05-01 18:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369401, 327825, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait! Nice sharp focus on the face and like the blurring on the rest - is it natural shallow DOF or blurring in post processing? Either way I like it. Lighting is a touch harsh on the face but exposure and sharpness are great.</td>', 'Lovely portrait! Nice sharp focus on the face and like the blurring on the rest - is it natural shallow DOF or blurring in post processing? Either way I like it. Lighting is a touch harsh on the face but exposure and sharpness are great.', '2006-05-01 18:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369405, 327546, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, those are odd little critters! :o)</td>', 'Ha ha, those are odd little critters! :o)', '2006-05-01 18:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369408, 328555, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is extremely intriguing with it''s mix of colour palettes and different textures and materials. Composition is good too. Only downside for me is lack of sharpness...</td>', 'This is extremely intriguing with it''s mix of colour palettes and different textures and materials. Composition is good too. Only downside for me is lack of sharpness...', '2006-05-01 18:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369409, 328049, 58224, '<td valign="top">i love the colour and the lighting. the reflection of the yellow of the daisy on to the face is very nice and the green of the eyes to the center of the daisy also with some pink under tones an all around great shot</td>', 'i love the colour and the lighting. the reflection of the yellow of the daisy on to the face is very nice and the green of the eyes to the center of the daisy also with some pink under tones an all around great shot', '2006-05-01 18:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369414, 328477, 29474, '<td valign="top">The strong white in the background is very distracting.</td>', 'The strong white in the background is very distracting.', '2006-05-01 18:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369417, 328440, 29474, '<td valign="top">I think that I would have cropped the two flowers on the right.</td>', 'I think that I would have cropped the two flowers on the right.', '2006-05-01 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369418, 327842, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of longer exposure to make a feature of the water.</td>', 'Nice use of longer exposure to make a feature of the water.', '2006-05-01 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369421, 328489, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image - makes me think of singing about green bottles on the wall. Kind of melancholy and intriguing.</td>', 'Nice image - makes me think of singing about green bottles on the wall. Kind of melancholy and intriguing.', '2006-05-01 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369423, 327765, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, nice details. What an interesting duck. Great capture.</td>', 'Nice reflections, nice details. What an interesting duck. Great capture.', '2006-05-01 18:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369425, 328431, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh this is great. An abstracted close up of what is probably a fairly abstract sculpture? Love the colours and texture here.</td>', 'Oooh this is great. An abstracted close up of what is probably a fairly abstract sculpture? Love the colours and texture here.', '2006-05-01 18:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369429, 328320, 29474, '<td valign="top">The rope looks too clean, especially against those hands.</td>', 'The rope looks too clean, especially against those hands.', '2006-05-01 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369430, 328249, 3087, '<td valign="top">Succeeds in conveying melancholy and isolation. A little too dark overall for my preferences, even with expanse of sky but perhaps that supports the theme.</td>', 'Succeeds in conveying melancholy and isolation. A little too dark overall for my preferences, even with expanse of sky but perhaps that supports the theme.', '2006-05-01 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369431, 328187, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition within the frame and nice detail and colour.</td>', 'Nice composition within the frame and nice detail and colour.', '2006-05-01 18:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369432, 328066, 29474, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting which really brings out the texture. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting which really brings out the texture. Well done.', '2006-05-01 18:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369435, 328066, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely floral portrait. Nice lighting. Black backdrop works well against the two main colours. Nicely lit. I like it. Only negative point for me is that framing feels tight - the leaf goes too close to the edge of the image - I feel it needs a touch more space.</td>', 'Lovely floral portrait. Nice lighting. Black backdrop works well against the two main colours. Nicely lit. I like it. Only negative point for me is that framing feels tight - the leaf goes too close to the edge of the image - I feel it needs a touch more space.', '2006-05-01 18:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369442, 328474, 29474, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like the focus is dead on the eyes. Nice swagger and attitude. Not sure about the cigar ... it cast an ugly shadow.</td>', 'It doesn''t look like the focus is dead on the eyes. Nice swagger and attitude. Not sure about the cigar ... it cast an ugly shadow.', '2006-05-01 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369443, 327901, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light! Wonderful shapes. A little too much canopy perhaps as opposed to the wonderfully interesting ground, trunks, light and shadow patterns... but really nice.</td>', 'Lovely light! Wonderful shapes. A little too much canopy perhaps as opposed to the wonderfully interesting ground, trunks, light and shadow patterns... but really nice.', '2006-05-01 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
