(2369508, 328088, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great idea - looks slightly OOF, especially on the bottom. If this was a DOF decision, it might not be working as well as you intended. Composition could be stronger if the tail weren''t cut off.  Also, not a huge fan of the border.  Overall, this is a shot with some potential - the strong yellow patterning on the lizard adds visual interest, as well as the web it''s crawling under.</td>', 'Great idea - looks slightly OOF, especially on the bottom. If this was a DOF decision, it might not be working as well as you intended. Composition could be stronger if the tail weren''t cut off.  Also, not a huge fan of the border.  Overall, this is a shot with some potential - the strong yellow patterning on the lizard adds visual interest, as well as the web it''s crawling under.', '2006-05-01 19:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
