(2369557, 328017, 22781, '<td valign="top">Now here is something I like, I tried something (not similar) once (somewhere in my challenge entry´s called candy) But I like this one much more.<br/>Great. 10 for just making a fun photo, btw how did you manage to get the ´dip´ to stick to her face?</td>', 'Now here is something I like, I tried something (not similar) once (somewhere in my challenge entry´s called candy) But I like this one much more.Great. 10 for just making a fun photo, btw how did you manage to get the ´dip´ to stick to her face?', '2006-05-01 19:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369558, 328543, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is good with a nice straight horizon line properly placed.  With regard to exposure, the tone is a bit flat and portions of the sky are completely blown out.  This image also looks a bit OOF.  A strong idea; overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'Composition is good with a nice straight horizon line properly placed.  With regard to exposure, the tone is a bit flat and portions of the sky are completely blown out.  This image also looks a bit OOF.  A strong idea; overall, a decent shot.', '2006-05-01 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
