(2369569, 328142, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colour and some nice textures there... Although the larger clump of trees provides a focal point it''s not enough of one for my preferences and I think it''s somewhat weakened by the smaller clump to the right. There seems to be some messy details at the edges of the frame at both left and right which interefere with the clean lines across the image.</td>', 'Great colour and some nice textures there... Although the larger clump of trees provides a focal point it''s not enough of one for my preferences and I think it''s somewhat weakened by the smaller clump to the right. There seems to be some messy details at the edges of the frame at both left and right which interefere with the clean lines across the image.', '2006-05-01 19:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369573, 328531, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is good with the lines on the stream leading the viewer through the shot and a nice straight horizon line well placed in the top third of the frame.  With regard to exposure - the sky is completely blown out and devoid of any detail.  PP could be stronger with regard to the color saturation, IMHO.  Overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'Composition is good with the lines on the stream leading the viewer through the shot and a nice straight horizon line well placed in the top third of the frame.  With regard to exposure - the sky is completely blown out and devoid of any detail.  PP could be stronger with regard to the color saturation, IMHO.  Overall, a decent shot.', '2006-05-01 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369575, 327614, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition here.</td>', 'Very strong composition here.', '2006-05-01 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369581, 327703, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is very strong here, good use of DOF, lovely muted tones.  Overall, nice job.</td>', 'Composition is very strong here, good use of DOF, lovely muted tones.  Overall, nice job.', '2006-05-01 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369584, 327665, 33725, '<td valign="top">The green cast bothers me, otherwise nice and sharp.</td>', 'The green cast bothers me, otherwise nice and sharp.', '2006-05-01 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369585, 328439, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white processing here - good strong contrast which works well. The subject itself is certainly also interesting - I''ve never seen it and yet am intrigued by what is clearly an old and ambitious bit of engineering. The composition doesn''t really work well for me. The angle of the near horizontal line of the bridge near the top of the frame make it feel off-kilter to me and somewhat top heavy. The area in the lower left feels dark and "muddy" in terms of lack of detail. I like it because I find it interesting but I don''t think the image works in terms of composition/ aesthetic punch.</td>', 'I like the black and white processing here - good strong contrast which works well. The subject itself is certainly also interesting - I''ve never seen it and yet am intrigued by what is clearly an old and ambitious bit of engineering. The composition doesn''t really work well for me. The angle of the near horizontal line of the bridge near the top of the frame make it feel off-kilter to me and somewhat top heavy. The area in the lower left feels dark and "muddy" in terms of lack of detail. I like it because I find it interesting but I don''t think the image works in terms of composition/ aesthetic punch.', '2006-05-01 19:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369586, 328456, 29009, '<td valign="top">With regard to composition - seems like there could be excess negative space?  Good detail on the eye.  I find myself wishing for a bit more texture in the feathers of the bird, but otherwise a nice job.</td>', 'With regard to composition - seems like there could be excess negative space?  Good detail on the eye.  I find myself wishing for a bit more texture in the feathers of the bird, but otherwise a nice job.', '2006-05-01 19:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369598, 328380, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good capture of "facial expression" and the emotional tenseness of the cat.  With regard to composition, I think maybe a tighter crop on the left and top of the frame.  With regard to exposure, image looks a bit flat and lacks contrast and sharpness.  This really isn''t the most visually interesting background/foreground.    Overall, this has more of a "snapshot" feel than I would expect to find in a Free Study challenge.</td>', 'Good capture of "facial expression" and the emotional tenseness of the cat.  With regard to composition, I think maybe a tighter crop on the left and top of the frame.  With regard to exposure, image looks a bit flat and lacks contrast and sharpness.  This really isn''t the most visually interesting background/foreground.    Overall, this has more of a "snapshot" feel than I would expect to find in a Free Study challenge.', '2006-05-01 19:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369605, 328452, 29474, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Execution is a bit weak. The windows seem to be wrong.</td>', 'Nice idea. Execution is a bit weak. The windows seem to be wrong.', '2006-05-01 19:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
