(2369638, 328233, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.  With regard to composition - looks a bit tight on the right side.  Lighting looks a bit harsh - sometimes it''s easier to capture projects like this in early morning or late afternoon.</td>', 'Good use of DOF.  With regard to composition - looks a bit tight on the right side.  Lighting looks a bit harsh - sometimes it''s easier to capture projects like this in early morning or late afternoon.', '2006-05-01 19:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369647, 327774, 29009, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, a new favorite image for me!  Having seen the "4 years ago" version, I''m delighted and amazed to see how closely you''ve matched the original vision.  Super, fantastic, wonderfully well done.  Composition is very strong, lighting is perfect, and that is the most amazing eye detail I''ve seen since the last one you did.  Good luck, Benbo!</td>', 'Ahhh, a new favorite image for me!  Having seen the "4 years ago" version, I''m delighted and amazed to see how closely you''ve matched the original vision.  Super, fantastic, wonderfully well done.  Composition is very strong, lighting is perfect, and that is the most amazing eye detail I''ve seen since the last one you did.  Good luck, Benbo!', '2006-05-01 19:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369657, 327847, 29009, '<td valign="top">Super duper nice job here.  Composition is strong, exposure is spot-on, colors are vibrant, perspective works well.  Overall, this is a very strong image that should do well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Super duper nice job here.  Composition is strong, exposure is spot-on, colors are vibrant, perspective works well.  Overall, this is a very strong image that should do well.  Good luck!', '2006-05-01 19:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
