(2369784, 328472, 41337, '<td valign="top">This probably could have worked for the DPC Cinema challenge if you could get the name right. It reminds me of a horror movie which had these people deformities (like no legs) and they were moving about in the woods sorta like this. Anyway, I can''t think of the name of that movie now! Sorry to go off on a tangent. 7!</td>', 'This probably could have worked for the DPC Cinema challenge if you could get the name right. It reminds me of a horror movie which had these people deformities (like no legs) and they were moving about in the woods sorta like this. Anyway, I can''t think of the name of that movie now! Sorry to go off on a tangent. 7!', '2006-05-01 20:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369788, 327577, 29474, '<td valign="top">A little more post-processing is needed. Looks like a Metro-Rail train in the countryside?</td>', 'A little more post-processing is needed. Looks like a Metro-Rail train in the countryside?', '2006-05-01 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369793, 328538, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the raw look to this.</td>', 'I like the raw look to this.', '2006-05-01 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369802, 328394, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great composition but would have loved to see some clouds. Couldn''t you have just thrown a few up there? :P</td>', 'Great composition but would have loved to see some clouds. Couldn''t you have just thrown a few up there? :P', '2006-05-01 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369808, 328533, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and the fence acts as a good leading line.  I think that B&amp;W was probably a good choice for this, as it tends to hide high contrast light a little, but for me, the high contrast light is too much for the scene to be captured properly.  I know it isn''t always possible, but later in the day or earlier in morning when the sun is low would offer better lighting.  JMO.</td>', 'Nice composition and the fence acts as a good leading line.  I think that B&W was probably a good choice for this, as it tends to hide high contrast light a little, but for me, the high contrast light is too much for the scene to be captured properly.  I know it isn''t always possible, but later in the day or earlier in morning when the sun is low would offer better lighting.  JMO.', '2006-05-01 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369813, 328057, 29474, '<td valign="top">Because of the direction of the light, there is very little texture on the petals, something I would have expected to see.</td>', 'Because of the direction of the light, there is very little texture on the petals, something I would have expected to see.', '2006-05-01 20:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369818, 327614, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I like the white on white here</td>', 'Very nice composition. I like the white on white here', '2006-05-01 20:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369819, 328269, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the detail/tonal range you captured. Also, the reflection in the sunglasses puts a nice stamp to this photo. Not crazy about the composition but it works. Gets an 8. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the detail/tonal range you captured. Also, the reflection in the sunglasses puts a nice stamp to this photo. Not crazy about the composition but it works. Gets an 8. Good luck!', '2006-05-01 20:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369825, 327901, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and use of wideangle lens.  Seems to lack sharpness.</td>', 'Good lighting and use of wideangle lens.  Seems to lack sharpness.', '2006-05-01 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369828, 328006, 41337, '<td valign="top">Lovely DOF. The cropping at the top I don''t like as much. Maybe crop a bit tighter so you don''t get the eye sockets or include them in the shot. As is it makes her look a little evil looking or maybe that was your intent? :)</td>', 'Lovely DOF. The cropping at the top I don''t like as much. Maybe crop a bit tighter so you don''t get the eye sockets or include them in the shot. As is it makes her look a little evil looking or maybe that was your intent? :)', '2006-05-01 20:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369830, 328082, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the flow and distortion.  Brilliant colors and lines.</td>', 'I like the flow and distortion.  Brilliant colors and lines.', '2006-05-01 20:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369845, 327955, 41337, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little tight but overall I like the composition. Also, nice detail.</td>', 'Composition is a little tight but overall I like the composition. Also, nice detail.', '2006-05-01 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369846, 328060, 41522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours and good use of the rule of thirds to compose your scene.  A couple of things that I think would improve this photo ... The top of the palm tree is cut off.  It would have been really ice to see all of the tree.  Also, on a minor note, the water line is just off of level (not by much but it is something I noticed).  JMO</td>', 'Fantastic colours and good use of the rule of thirds to compose your scene.  A couple of things that I think would improve this photo ... The top of the palm tree is cut off.  It would have been really ice to see all of the tree.  Also, on a minor note, the water line is just off of level (not by much but it is something I noticed).  JMO', '2006-05-01 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2369904, 327513, 51385, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot!  good luck to you.</td>', 'I really liked this shot!  good luck to you.', '2006-05-01 20:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
