(2370040, 328550, 45790, '<td valign="top">I had a teacher who said that dogwoods were lousy flowers to shoot. Indeed, I could never get an appealing one. What makes a dogwood attractive is the abundance of flowers rather than the individual ones. Also, petals in foreground attract the eyes but are out of focus.</td>', 'I had a teacher who said that dogwoods were lousy flowers to shoot. Indeed, I could never get an appealing one. What makes a dogwood attractive is the abundance of flowers rather than the individual ones. Also, petals in foreground attract the eyes but are out of focus.', '2006-05-01 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370043, 328227, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp capture!</td>', 'Nice, sharp capture!', '2006-05-01 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370055, 327657, 45790, '<td valign="top">Gook job with the eyes, but the face looks washed out (nose is overexposed) and I think the white balance is off.</td>', 'Gook job with the eyes, but the face looks washed out (nose is overexposed) and I think the white balance is off.', '2006-05-01 21:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
