(2370228, 327720, 40370, '<td valign="top">All the cleat footprints are cool, the image is a bit too bright though, probably mid-day sun reflection off the dirt. Too bad about the player, hope nothin''s broken.</td>', 'All the cleat footprints are cool, the image is a bit too bright though, probably mid-day sun reflection off the dirt. Too bad about the player, hope nothin''s broken.', '2006-05-01 22:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370249, 328012, 26756, '<td valign="top">Composition and subject are very nice, I''m just thinking there is too much processing going on.</td>', 'Composition and subject are very nice, I''m just thinking there is too much processing going on.', '2006-05-01 22:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370255, 327788, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice and interesting shot with the fence.  Might have brought the eye in darkness up a tad too much.  It''s nice to see part of the eye but it looks unnatural.  Maybe that''s teh look you were going for.  Great pic, like the tones too.</td>', 'Nice and interesting shot with the fence.  Might have brought the eye in darkness up a tad too much.  It''s nice to see part of the eye but it looks unnatural.  Maybe that''s teh look you were going for.  Great pic, like the tones too.', '2006-05-01 22:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370267, 328447, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait part of this image, her face is appropriately lit and she''s giving you a great smile but I feel that the top is a little tightly cropped and the flowers are a bit blown out. Keep up the good work, hopefully she''s got a lot more smiles for the camera.</td>', 'I like the portrait part of this image, her face is appropriately lit and she''s giving you a great smile but I feel that the top is a little tightly cropped and the flowers are a bit blown out. Keep up the good work, hopefully she''s got a lot more smiles for the camera.', '2006-05-01 22:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370274, 328221, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, I may have tried cropping the bottom a bit more so the sand and darker brown water''s edge were the same height. Also I''d like the blues bumped up and the red/oranges bumped down a bit.</td>', 'Nice lines, I may have tried cropping the bottom a bit more so the sand and darker brown water''s edge were the same height. Also I''d like the blues bumped up and the red/oranges bumped down a bit.', '2006-05-01 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370287, 327660, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, I like the decision for the eggs to stand out in color, but I would like to see what this would look like as B &amp; W (with blue eggs of course), somehow I feel the brown sepia tones just don''t compliment the cyan blue.</td>', 'Nice setting, I like the decision for the eggs to stand out in color, but I would like to see what this would look like as B & W (with blue eggs of course), somehow I feel the brown sepia tones just don''t compliment the cyan blue.', '2006-05-01 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370298, 327798, 53164, '<td valign="top">love the dof. like the placement of everything in the pic it is gorgeous and well executed. incredible.</td>', 'love the dof. like the placement of everything in the pic it is gorgeous and well executed. incredible.', '2006-05-01 22:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370303, 327615, 53164, '<td valign="top">great find and capture. well done.  the colors are great. rarity to find the lady bugs like that.</td>', 'great find and capture. well done.  the colors are great. rarity to find the lady bugs like that.', '2006-05-01 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370304, 328015, 53164, '<td valign="top">this is great. nice post.</td>', 'this is great. nice post.', '2006-05-01 22:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
