(2373255, 328147, 36065, '<td valign="top">No Gasper that day, huh?  I am assuming that the is the Georgia Aquarium, but could be worng.  Either way, very nicely done, especially with the lighting conditions you were faced with inside any aquarium.  Nice exposure and great composition.  One of my favorites in this challenge so far.  My only small complaint is that the lone tail at the top of the frame is a bit distracting.  Very nice overall.</td>', 'No Gasper that day, huh?  I am assuming that the is the Georgia Aquarium, but could be worng.  Either way, very nicely done, especially with the lighting conditions you were faced with inside any aquarium.  Nice exposure and great composition.  One of my favorites in this challenge so far.  My only small complaint is that the lone tail at the top of the frame is a bit distracting.  Very nice overall.', '2006-05-02 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373266, 327775, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, and cool use of the starlight camera filter.  I think this one would heve been even better without the sky in the frame.  The chrome almost gets lost in the brightness of the sky.</td>', 'Nice capture, and cool use of the starlight camera filter.  I think this one would heve been even better without the sky in the frame.  The chrome almost gets lost in the brightness of the sky.', '2006-05-02 18:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373272, 327766, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nothing is really in focus here, and everything except the bird is chopped off.  I thnk this one would have benefitted from shifting your position some and picking a spot to focus on.</td>', 'Nothing is really in focus here, and everything except the bird is chopped off.  I thnk this one would have benefitted from shifting your position some and picking a spot to focus on.', '2006-05-02 18:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373281, 328191, 36065, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very nice.  Perfect focus, nice coloring and great composition.  My only criticism is the small black object intruding into the frame at the top.  A little bit of cloning and this one would be near perfect.</td>', 'Wow!  Very nice.  Perfect focus, nice coloring and great composition.  My only criticism is the small black object intruding into the frame at the top.  A little bit of cloning and this one would be near perfect.', '2006-05-02 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373286, 328509, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and I have no idea how you did this.  Very creative and very nicely lit.  I think cropping jsut a bit off the right would have made this one even better.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice, and I have no idea how you did this.  Very creative and very nicely lit.  I think cropping jsut a bit off the right would have made this one even better.  Nice job!', '2006-05-02 18:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373291, 327983, 36065, '<td valign="top">While I like the choice of subject you made here, I think that the horse butt is a bit too prominent.  I think shifting your position or just waiting for them to move would have greatly improved this shot.  Your DOF use is well done and isolates the crisp subject from the blurred background.</td>', 'While I like the choice of subject you made here, I think that the horse butt is a bit too prominent.  I think shifting your position or just waiting for them to move would have greatly improved this shot.  Your DOF use is well done and isolates the crisp subject from the blurred background.', '2006-05-02 18:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373296, 327750, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I feel that the focus is off.  I can''t really pick out an area of perfect focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I feel that the focus is off.  I can''t really pick out an area of perfect focus.', '2006-05-02 18:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373323, 327824, 36065, '<td valign="top">Intersting subjects, but the lighting is a bit too harsh to pull this one off.  Both are nicely focused and I like the way it seems that they are looking at each other.  Perhaps a bit of fill flash would have improved the lighting, but chances are that shooting them at a different time of day would have been the best solution.</td>', 'Intersting subjects, but the lighting is a bit too harsh to pull this one off.  Both are nicely focused and I like the way it seems that they are looking at each other.  Perhaps a bit of fill flash would have improved the lighting, but chances are that shooting them at a different time of day would have been the best solution.', '2006-05-02 18:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
