(2373527, 328229, 46778, '<td valign="top">Ahh.. Spring. So many colors and flowers. Good job in catching some of that ad nice DOF to isulate your desired subject, Good luck -7-</td>', 'Ahh.. Spring. So many colors and flowers. Good job in catching some of that ad nice DOF to isulate your desired subject, Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
