(2373535, 328179, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition. DOF is also very good. Maby losing a little bit to much of the flower IMHO. Good luck -7-</td>', 'Nice colors and composition. DOF is also very good. Maby losing a little bit to much of the flower IMHO. Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 20:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373536, 328238, 24642, '<td valign="top">Funny in a way.  Well composed although I would have liked to see all the hand on the left.</td>', 'Funny in a way.  Well composed although I would have liked to see all the hand on the left.', '2006-05-02 20:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373538, 327720, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint, good colors.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint, good colors.', '2006-05-02 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373540, 328373, 46778, '<td valign="top">I''m glad that I''m not where you live - still snow/ice on the ground? The yellow drink add''s interesting color to a fairly monochrmatic shoot. Lighting and color are good. The only thing that I would change are the furniture and pose against the wall, but that is just my thought. Good luck -7-</td>', 'I''m glad that I''m not where you live - still snow/ice on the ground? The yellow drink add''s interesting color to a fairly monochrmatic shoot. Lighting and color are good. The only thing that I would change are the furniture and pose against the wall, but that is just my thought. Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373541, 327505, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great tones and composition.  The light flares really add to the photo.</td>', 'Great tones and composition.  The light flares really add to the photo.', '2006-05-02 20:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373545, 327594, 24642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones on these interesting plants.  Very delicate work.</td>', 'Beautiful tones on these interesting plants.  Very delicate work.', '2006-05-02 20:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373555, 328195, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  Post processing looks good.</td>', 'Good perspective.  Post processing looks good.', '2006-05-02 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373566, 328249, 46778, '<td valign="top">Love the one tree alone shoot. Clouds are dramatic and B&amp;W add''s as well. Good luck -8-</td>', 'Love the one tree alone shoot. Clouds are dramatic and B&W add''s as well. Good luck -8-', '2006-05-02 20:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373570, 328386, 46778, '<td valign="top">Now that is a macro shoot. This gives a whole new meaning to flowers. Colors and subject are great. Good luck. -8-</td>', 'Now that is a macro shoot. This gives a whole new meaning to flowers. Colors and subject are great. Good luck. -8-', '2006-05-02 20:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373573, 327693, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice rule of thirds. Sky is fantastic. I whish that the grass would be a little bit brighter. Good luck -7-</td>', 'Nice rule of thirds. Sky is fantastic. I whish that the grass would be a little bit brighter. Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 20:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373579, 327517, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and funny shoot. Next time save larger for the web (640pix max) so that we can see more detail. Good luck -7-</td>', 'Nice colors and funny shoot. Next time save larger for the web (640pix max) so that we can see more detail. Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 20:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373602, 328335, 46778, '<td valign="top">Are you shure that you did not come in my yard and took a picture of my dogs. I have two GSD that live for the ball. Check out one of my early entries to the "Garbadge" contest. Good shoot as well with great colors and DOF. Good luck -8- PS: my spelling is bad - sorry</td>', 'Are you shure that you did not come in my yard and took a picture of my dogs. I have two GSD that live for the ball. Check out one of my early entries to the "Garbadge" contest. Good shoot as well with great colors and DOF. Good luck -8- PS: my spelling is bad - sorry', '2006-05-02 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373606, 327687, 46778, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice close up with iteresting colors. Good luck -7-</td>', 'Very cool. Nice close up with iteresting colors. Good luck -7-', '2006-05-02 20:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373645, 328481, 52516, '<td valign="top">Love the different angle.</td>', 'Love the different angle.', '2006-05-02 20:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373672, 327615, 51538, '<td valign="top">Those bugs look rather as if they are mini hovercraft.  A pretty concept photo.</td>', 'Those bugs look rather as if they are mini hovercraft.  A pretty concept photo.', '2006-05-02 20:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373680, 328195, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the way you took the photo from pew-height.  Lovely colours and architecture.</td>', 'I like the way you took the photo from pew-height.  Lovely colours and architecture.', '2006-05-02 20:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373787, 327891, 7743, '<td valign="top">What I like: streaks of colour in the background and stars on the headlights<br/> <br/>What''s not working for me: central location of car, bottom half of image doesn''t add anything to its dynamics -- zooming in more or shifting the camera upward and to the right would take care of these things (just my opinion)</td>', 'What I like: streaks of colour in the background and stars on the headlights What''s not working for me: central location of car, bottom half of image doesn''t add anything to its dynamics -- zooming in more or shifting the camera upward and to the right would take care of these things (just my opinion)', '2006-05-02 21:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373798, 327817, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours in the lit area are nice and none seem blown (except maybe the one on the far left), however the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'The colours in the lit area are nice and none seem blown (except maybe the one on the far left), however the horizon is tilted.', '2006-05-02 21:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373861, 328249, 44242, '<td valign="top">i''ve seen this shot done many times before, but its still a good composition! The sillouette is nice and strong, but the detail is lost a bit in the shadows on my screen.</td>', 'i''ve seen this shot done many times before, but its still a good composition! The sillouette is nice and strong, but the detail is lost a bit in the shadows on my screen.', '2006-05-02 21:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373866, 328032, 44242, '<td valign="top">Cool composition and awesome color. the focus is nice on the subject. good shadow detail too.</td>', 'Cool composition and awesome color. the focus is nice on the subject. good shadow detail too.', '2006-05-02 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373868, 328191, 44242, '<td valign="top">very good subject isolation and sharpness. i like the OOF quality too.</td>', 'very good subject isolation and sharpness. i like the OOF quality too.', '2006-05-02 21:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373872, 328185, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice panning shot. good background blur and subject sharpness.</td>', 'nice panning shot. good background blur and subject sharpness.', '2006-05-02 21:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373881, 328428, 44242, '<td valign="top">i like the softness, and shallow DOF. the flower in focus doesn''t stand out that much though because its in shade.</td>', 'i like the softness, and shallow DOF. the flower in focus doesn''t stand out that much though because its in shade.', '2006-05-02 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373884, 327867, 10432, '<td valign="top">Wow - great shot!  Looks like a studio portrait.  I had a chance to see him work a couple of years ago when we visited RPFS.<br/> <br/>Wonderful!</td>', 'Wow - great shot!  Looks like a studio portrait.  I had a chance to see him work a couple of years ago when we visited RPFS. Wonderful!', '2006-05-02 21:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373887, 328191, 58010, '<td valign="top">wow. i love this picture.. i love the detail on the spider. good job. and good luck :]</td>', 'wow. i love this picture.. i love the detail on the spider. good job. and good luck :]', '2006-05-02 21:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373890, 328394, 44242, '<td valign="top">cool shot. great depth and i love the texture of the foreground.</td>', 'cool shot. great depth and i love the texture of the foreground.', '2006-05-02 21:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373894, 328179, 44242, '<td valign="top">nice softness. has an abstract quality as well.</td>', 'nice softness. has an abstract quality as well.', '2006-05-02 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373899, 327615, 44242, '<td valign="top">cool concept, but the 3 colors clash a little for me. really great sharpness on all of the flower.</td>', 'cool concept, but the 3 colors clash a little for me. really great sharpness on all of the flower.', '2006-05-02 21:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373903, 328003, 49773, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup</td>', 'Interesting setup', '2006-05-02 21:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373905, 327849, 44242, '<td valign="top">great shot. the trees give a great sense of scale. i find the title too descriptive.</td>', 'great shot. the trees give a great sense of scale. i find the title too descriptive.', '2006-05-02 21:38:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2373910, 327843, 44242, '<td valign="top">good delineation between focus and oof but there is a lack fo sharpness, maybe causd by jpg conversion or noise reduction?</td>', 'good delineation between focus and oof but there is a lack fo sharpness, maybe causd by jpg conversion or noise reduction?', '2006-05-02 21:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373911, 328429, 49773, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2006-05-02 21:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373918, 328454, 44242, '<td valign="top">nicely done. would be interested to read the exposure info when posted.</td>', 'nicely done. would be interested to read the exposure info when posted.', '2006-05-02 21:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373922, 328477, 44242, '<td valign="top">good title, and really nice macro. i know DOF is really hard to control on these shots with moving subjects etc, but it would have been good to get just a little more of the subject in sharpness.</td>', 'good title, and really nice macro. i know DOF is really hard to control on these shots with moving subjects etc, but it would have been good to get just a little more of the subject in sharpness.', '2006-05-02 21:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373960, 328396, 50355, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really seemed like it''s focused.</td>', 'Doesn''t really seemed like it''s focused.', '2006-05-02 21:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373963, 327720, 50355, '<td valign="top">Good colors, but the angle of the shot just seems odd.</td>', 'Good colors, but the angle of the shot just seems odd.', '2006-05-02 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373966, 328381, 50355, '<td valign="top">Great angle, not too many colors, but sharp enough.</td>', 'Great angle, not too many colors, but sharp enough.', '2006-05-02 22:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373968, 328389, 50355, '<td valign="top">Great depth, but maybe over sharpened.</td>', 'Great depth, but maybe over sharpened.', '2006-05-02 22:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373973, 327577, 50355, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Maybe the train would have been better with about half the blur.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Maybe the train would have been better with about half the blur.', '2006-05-02 22:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373978, 327965, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image seems a little soft, I would really like to see it sharper.</td>', 'Image seems a little soft, I would really like to see it sharper.', '2006-05-02 22:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373979, 327931, 43774, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look in focus.</td>', 'Doesn''t look in focus.', '2006-05-02 22:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373981, 327533, 43774, '<td valign="top">Grainy &amp; the harsh sunlight is not helping the image any.</td>', 'Grainy & the harsh sunlight is not helping the image any.', '2006-05-02 22:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373984, 328212, 50355, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit bright.  Maybe could have used a contrast edit.</td>', 'Seems a bit bright.  Maybe could have used a contrast edit.', '2006-05-02 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373986, 328481, 50355, '<td valign="top">Good variation on the famous DPC flower theme.</td>', 'Good variation on the famous DPC flower theme.', '2006-05-02 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2373995, 328002, 50355, '<td valign="top">The stuff in the background is just a little distracting.  Good picture though.</td>', 'The stuff in the background is just a little distracting.  Good picture though.', '2006-05-02 22:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374003, 328545, 50355, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little bit of sharpening could help.</td>', 'Maybe a little bit of sharpening could help.', '2006-05-02 22:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374005, 328195, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is simply fantastic.  Great use of available light.  I look forward to seeing where this is.</td>', 'This is simply fantastic.  Great use of available light.  I look forward to seeing where this is.', '2006-05-02 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374008, 328017, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The things we do to get the shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  The things we do to get the shot.', '2006-05-02 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374011, 327657, 50355, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad bit bright.</td>', 'Seems a tad bit bright.', '2006-05-02 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374022, 328044, 16965, '<td valign="top">I see the Spider, but I think the soft focus takes away from the image.</td>', 'I see the Spider, but I think the soft focus takes away from the image.', '2006-05-02 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374046, 328226, 29293, '<td valign="top">the title is superb.  good layering and color in the composition</td>', 'the title is superb.  good layering and color in the composition', '2006-05-02 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374073, 327444, 56658, '<td valign="top">I love the idea but am not so sure i like the DOF. maybe a silver knife would help as well.</td>', 'I love the idea but am not so sure i like the DOF. maybe a silver knife would help as well.', '2006-05-02 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374136, 328453, 5885, '<td valign="top">Really awesome shot.</td>', 'Really awesome shot.', '2006-05-02 22:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374147, 328538, 5885, '<td valign="top">I wonder if it says anything bad about me that I always seem to stop and look at the nude shots longer than the flower shots? <br/> <br/>This one is pretty well done. A little over-sharpened it appears.</td>', 'I wonder if it says anything bad about me that I always seem to stop and look at the nude shots longer than the flower shots?  This one is pretty well done. A little over-sharpened it appears.', '2006-05-02 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374150, 328249, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalism and black and white. Good job.</td>', 'Nice minimalism and black and white. Good job.', '2006-05-02 22:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374153, 328404, 36065, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the land looks like it slices through the water.  The focus is super crisp and the composition is very nice.  One pet peeve of mine is a titlted horizon.  While you don''t have a strong tilt, its there.  Its probably not even noticeable if you''re not looking for it.  Great color saturation and exposed very well.</td>', 'I really like the way the land looks like it slices through the water.  The focus is super crisp and the composition is very nice.  One pet peeve of mine is a titlted horizon.  While you don''t have a strong tilt, its there.  Its probably not even noticeable if you''re not looking for it.  Great color saturation and exposed very well.', '2006-05-02 22:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374172, 328543, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here, but the sky needs some work.  You positioning for the shot is very appealing and the focus is crisp.  Perhaps an CP or graduated ND filter would have helped with keeping the sky properly exposed.  I do like the crop, andit looks like a place I''d like to live.</td>', 'Nice composition here, but the sky needs some work.  You positioning for the shot is very appealing and the focus is crisp.  Perhaps an CP or graduated ND filter would have helped with keeping the sky properly exposed.  I do like the crop, andit looks like a place I''d like to live.', '2006-05-02 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374179, 328127, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot--certainly worth the wait. It''s too bad that that the bird was not further out on the rock ledge so you could avoid the cluttered background of the rocks.</td>', 'This is a nice shot--certainly worth the wait. It''s too bad that that the bird was not further out on the rock ledge so you could avoid the cluttered background of the rocks.', '2006-05-02 22:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374189, 328199, 36065, '<td valign="top">You pulled off a nice square crop with this one.  Very nice composition, and the focus looks to be dead on.  I think that I''d clone out the shadows in the left corners, but not much else.  This should finish fairly well.</td>', 'You pulled off a nice square crop with this one.  Very nice composition, and the focus looks to be dead on.  I think that I''d clone out the shadows in the left corners, but not much else.  This should finish fairly well.', '2006-05-02 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374198, 327546, 35334, '<td valign="top">I like this more that I expected to. It''s kitch but it is just different enough to appeal to me. Even the static composition works reasonably well for this subject matter.</td>', 'I like this more that I expected to. It''s kitch but it is just different enough to appeal to me. Even the static composition works reasonably well for this subject matter.', '2006-05-02 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374203, 328504, 36065, '<td valign="top">The strength in this photo is the depth of field.  The focus on the kid and his glove is really nice and the background is isolated with the blur.  I like the toning you have chosen, but the tonal range looks a little flat.  Perhaps a curves adjustment would fix this right up and add some needed contrast.  Good eye and Go Braves.  At least I think that''s a tomahawk I see on the right there.</td>', 'The strength in this photo is the depth of field.  The focus on the kid and his glove is really nice and the background is isolated with the blur.  I like the toning you have chosen, but the tonal range looks a little flat.  Perhaps a curves adjustment would fix this right up and add some needed contrast.  Good eye and Go Braves.  At least I think that''s a tomahawk I see on the right there.', '2006-05-02 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374207, 328148, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and well composed.  The tonal range looks very nice and your focus is crisp.  I like what you achieved here.</td>', 'Very nice idea and well composed.  The tonal range looks very nice and your focus is crisp.  I like what you achieved here.', '2006-05-02 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374210, 327891, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice panning shot.  You subject is remarkably clear.  My only little knit to pick is that the car is just a bit too centered.  Not enough to alter the score in my mind, but I''d like to see it a bit back to the left of the frame.</td>', 'Nice panning shot.  You subject is remarkably clear.  My only little knit to pick is that the car is just a bit too centered.  Not enough to alter the score in my mind, but I''d like to see it a bit back to the left of the frame.', '2006-05-02 23:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374214, 327657, 29770, '<td valign="top">I like your crop on this picture.  Something about it draws you in.  The only critique I have is the color in the hair.  She looks like a beautiful blonde, but her hair has a bit of a green cast to it.  Could just be my monitor, so I''m not knocking the score for it.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'I like your crop on this picture.  Something about it draws you in.  The only critique I have is the color in the hair.  She looks like a beautiful blonde, but her hair has a bit of a green cast to it.  Could just be my monitor, so I''m not knocking the score for it. Good job.', '2006-05-02 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374220, 328265, 35334, '<td valign="top">Worst enemies? Two very different dogs having nothing to do with each other in spite of the close proximity. Suggestions: a higher camera angle would eliminate the distracting houses and trees in the distance. The image also seems to be a little over processes--the tones don''t seem natural to me.</td>', 'Worst enemies? Two very different dogs having nothing to do with each other in spite of the close proximity. Suggestions: a higher camera angle would eliminate the distracting houses and trees in the distance. The image also seems to be a little over processes--the tones don''t seem natural to me.', '2006-05-02 23:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374223, 327588, 29770, '<td valign="top">I''v seen this vantage point before, but I like this shot even better.  The colors are wonderful!  Nice job.</td>', 'I''v seen this vantage point before, but I like this shot even better.  The colors are wonderful!  Nice job.', '2006-05-02 23:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374231, 328519, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice skyline but there is nothing to lift it out of the ordinary.</td>', 'This is a very nice skyline but there is nothing to lift it out of the ordinary.', '2006-05-02 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374240, 328545, 29770, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this picture.  A hard, but good life.<br/> <br/>The white wall looks a little blown out, but probably not other way to get the detail on your subject.</td>', 'I like the feel of this picture.  A hard, but good life. The white wall looks a little blown out, but probably not other way to get the detail on your subject.', '2006-05-02 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374242, 328321, 36065, '<td valign="top">First of all, she us beautiful.  She looks completely comfortable being photographed, and that''s not always easily achieved.  Your composition is nice, focus flawless and depth of field use impeccable.  I do think that your tones are just a hair flat, but could be easily remedied with a curves adjustment in photoshop (or similar).  Over all, this is a very nice shot.  Great pose and terrific expression.  Beyond the curves adjustment, I may fix that hair over her left ear, but that''d be about it.</td>', 'First of all, she us beautiful.  She looks completely comfortable being photographed, and that''s not always easily achieved.  Your composition is nice, focus flawless and depth of field use impeccable.  I do think that your tones are just a hair flat, but could be easily remedied with a curves adjustment in photoshop (or similar).  Over all, this is a very nice shot.  Great pose and terrific expression.  Beyond the curves adjustment, I may fix that hair over her left ear, but that''d be about it.', '2006-05-02 23:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374250, 328447, 36065, '<td valign="top">Normally, I do not like vingetting, but it really works in the capture.  This is a great expression that you have caught, and the crop works very well.  I''d like to see her catch lights a bit stronger, but nice photo over all.</td>', 'Normally, I do not like vingetting, but it really works in the capture.  This is a great expression that you have caught, and the crop works very well.  I''d like to see her catch lights a bit stronger, but nice photo over all.', '2006-05-02 23:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2374254, 328435, 35334, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of a critical moment. I agree with the cropping--eliminating the face directs the attention to the legs and the skate board. Unfortunately I find the background distracting.</td>', 'Very nice capture of a critical moment. I agree with the cropping--eliminating the face directs the attention to the legs and the skate board. Unfortunately I find the background distracting.', '2006-05-02 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
