(2383354, 327775, 36914, '<td valign="top">The lens flar is a little distracting and cropped a little close.  Maybe shoot it at a angle from the front.</td>', 'The lens flar is a little distracting and cropped a little close.  Maybe shoot it at a angle from the front.', '2006-05-04 21:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
