(2383939, 328538, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pose and the composition is good.  The image feels a little too contrasty to me ... it makes the lighting feel harsh and somehow it doesn''t feel right to me for a feminine subject.  I hope you get what I mean.</td>', 'This is a nice pose and the composition is good.  The image feels a little too contrasty to me ... it makes the lighting feel harsh and somehow it doesn''t feel right to me for a feminine subject.  I hope you get what I mean.', '2006-05-05 01:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383956, 328477, 41522, '<td valign="top">There is another image very similar to this that I like a little bit more.  The background on this is a little bright and distracting for me.  JMO.</td>', 'There is another image very similar to this that I like a little bit more.  The background on this is a little bright and distracting for me.  JMO.', '2006-05-05 01:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384003, 327615, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot but I;m quite certain you know this. Sure to ribbon for a myriad of reasons. Here are some of mine: superb composition and deep dof, accurate &amp; telling title (a rarity IMHO here at dpc)and nice contrast of colours. Everything really pops out at you without one object over shadowing the others. Sure to ribbon. Good luck! 10</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot but I;m quite certain you know this. Sure to ribbon for a myriad of reasons. Here are some of mine: superb composition and deep dof, accurate & telling title (a rarity IMHO here at dpc)and nice contrast of colours. Everything really pops out at you without one object over shadowing the others. Sure to ribbon. Good luck! 10', '2006-05-05 01:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384009, 328012, 12268, '<td valign="top">Wow! I originally scored this a 7... don;t know what I was thinking. I''m very pleased that I''ve come back to this shot as it deserves a serious bump up. I attention went striaght to the eyes as it should. You''ve done a beautiful job with this capture. I like the post processing here as well. A dark * dangerous feel to it but with a touch of softness. It''s perfect. 10. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow! I originally scored this a 7... don;t know what I was thinking. I''m very pleased that I''ve come back to this shot as it deserves a serious bump up. I attention went striaght to the eyes as it should. You''ve done a beautiful job with this capture. I like the post processing here as well. A dark * dangerous feel to it but with a touch of softness. It''s perfect. 10. Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-05-05 01:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384023, 327850, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a nice exposure with excellent detail and a good range of tones, but the composition is too cluttered and static for my taste. Maybe a wider view might have worked better. Another thing you might want to consider would be adding some people to the composition. The addition of a skipper and a mate or two, messing around on deck with lines and other sailor stuff, might result in a much more interesting photo.</td>', 'This is a nice exposure with excellent detail and a good range of tones, but the composition is too cluttered and static for my taste. Maybe a wider view might have worked better. Another thing you might want to consider would be adding some people to the composition. The addition of a skipper and a mate or two, messing around on deck with lines and other sailor stuff, might result in a much more interesting photo.', '2006-05-05 01:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384038, 327660, 16230, '<td valign="top">I think you did everything just fine, with the exception of the ever elusive ''wow'' factor. You did a good job with the selective desat, and you captured a nice exposure with decent sharpness and lots of detail, but IMHO the image lacks sufficient pop to get the higher scores. I''m giving it a 7 for now.</td>', 'I think you did everything just fine, with the exception of the ever elusive ''wow'' factor. You did a good job with the selective desat, and you captured a nice exposure with decent sharpness and lots of detail, but IMHO the image lacks sufficient pop to get the higher scores. I''m giving it a 7 for now.', '2006-05-05 02:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384049, 328049, 16230, '<td valign="top">Hey, now there''s a good way to make a flower shot more interesting. Well done!</td>', 'Hey, now there''s a good way to make a flower shot more interesting. Well done!', '2006-05-05 02:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
