(2384315, 328555, 51125, '<td valign="top">Whatever happened to the colors it is too much for me.  Like the textures.</td>', 'Whatever happened to the colors it is too much for me.  Like the textures.', '2006-05-05 04:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384317, 327895, 51125, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of moment.  I would crop closer and work on color correction.  The skin tone is too pink and could be fixes for a tender moment.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of moment.  I would crop closer and work on color correction.  The skin tone is too pink and could be fixes for a tender moment.', '2006-05-05 04:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384318, 328082, 51125, '<td valign="top">I can see faces.  Wonderful work.l</td>', 'I can see faces.  Wonderful work.l', '2006-05-05 04:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384325, 328452, 51125, '<td valign="top">You have great light and a simple shot.  I would lose the windows all together.</td>', 'You have great light and a simple shot.  I would lose the windows all together.', '2006-05-05 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384380, 327771, 51125, '<td valign="top">Strong colors and good light.  Straight on may have made this even more powerful.</td>', 'Strong colors and good light.  Straight on may have made this even more powerful.', '2006-05-05 05:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384531, 328542, 35602, '<td valign="top">Color needs to be corrected.  also the white of the girls shirt is way overexposed.  Adjustments may have been okay in the red range.  Congratulations on the engagement.  Nice couple.</td>', 'Color needs to be corrected.  also the white of the girls shirt is way overexposed.  Adjustments may have been okay in the red range.  Congratulations on the engagement.  Nice couple.', '2006-05-05 07:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384535, 327772, 35602, '<td valign="top">Way out of focus.  I guess the yellow stuff was maybe pollen, but the capture didn''t get it clear enough.  Your dof may have been too low.  Pictures like this taken on an aperture range of between 5.6 and 8.4 may give you a better dof.  Also, stepping away and taking the shot further back with more zoom and a tripod would give you a clearer image.</td>', 'Way out of focus.  I guess the yellow stuff was maybe pollen, but the capture didn''t get it clear enough.  Your dof may have been too low.  Pictures like this taken on an aperture range of between 5.6 and 8.4 may give you a better dof.  Also, stepping away and taking the shot further back with more zoom and a tripod would give you a clearer image.', '2006-05-05 07:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384538, 328134, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needs clearer focus to show detail of petals.  Also need to adjust exposure so there are not so many blown highlights.</td>', 'Needs clearer focus to show detail of petals.  Also need to adjust exposure so there are not so many blown highlights.', '2006-05-05 07:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384539, 328396, 35602, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be better, though your exposure was done well.</td>', 'Focus needs to be better, though your exposure was done well.', '2006-05-05 07:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384543, 328212, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need better focus.  There is also something wrong on the walkway.  It seems to be very unevenly exposed and color seems to not match the scene all that well.  Anyway, the topic needs work as well.  Maybe zooming in on the columns with steps leading to them would make a better image.  Trees did not add to the overall theme of the image.</td>', 'Need better focus.  There is also something wrong on the walkway.  It seems to be very unevenly exposed and color seems to not match the scene all that well.  Anyway, the topic needs work as well.  Maybe zooming in on the columns with steps leading to them would make a better image.  Trees did not add to the overall theme of the image.', '2006-05-05 07:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384546, 328489, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems too dark.  Bottles are good subjects but not as they are placed in this image.  Need more highlights, or maybe overlaying them one behind the other, or something to add more interest.</td>', 'Seems too dark.  Bottles are good subjects but not as they are placed in this image.  Need more highlights, or maybe overlaying them one behind the other, or something to add more interest.', '2006-05-05 07:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384550, 327766, 35602, '<td valign="top">On this one the focus needs to be sharper and I think that the cut off head of the little boy was probably the wrong thing to do.  It works in some cases but not on full shots like this one.  Shallower dof could also improve the image by placing out of focus the legs in the background and the carraige wheels.</td>', 'On this one the focus needs to be sharper and I think that the cut off head of the little boy was probably the wrong thing to do.  It works in some cases but not on full shots like this one.  Shallower dof could also improve the image by placing out of focus the legs in the background and the carraige wheels.', '2006-05-05 07:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384551, 327577, 35602, '<td valign="top">Saturation and contrast should be stronger to separate the train more from the background.</td>', 'Saturation and contrast should be stronger to separate the train more from the background.', '2006-05-05 07:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384553, 328207, 35602, '<td valign="top">The glare of the sun kind of overpowers the plane on this one.  It also was very dark, making the plane even harder to see.  I get the idea that this may have been shot during the day but the extreme underexposure is what caused you to create the title that you did.</td>', 'The glare of the sun kind of overpowers the plane on this one.  It also was very dark, making the plane even harder to see.  I get the idea that this may have been shot during the day but the extreme underexposure is what caused you to create the title that you did.', '2006-05-05 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384557, 328386, 35602, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be clearer and color balance is way off.  If you were trying to sharpen the image by adjusting contrast, often the result is off colors in the composition.  Perhaps stepping back, using an aperture of about 5 or 6, and zooming in on subject to make it get closer would clear up the focus issue.</td>', 'Focus needs to be clearer and color balance is way off.  If you were trying to sharpen the image by adjusting contrast, often the result is off colors in the composition.  Perhaps stepping back, using an aperture of about 5 or 6, and zooming in on subject to make it get closer would clear up the focus issue.', '2006-05-05 07:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384559, 327468, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not enough detail to convince me this is a spider.  Minimalism is a good technique, but this may have been too small of an area to fill the frame properly.</td>', 'Not enough detail to convince me this is a spider.  Minimalism is a good technique, but this may have been too small of an area to fill the frame properly.', '2006-05-05 07:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384562, 328201, 35602, '<td valign="top">Dried florals are wonderful subjects, but this one seems to need more color in it.  It isn''t the most attractive rendering of a dried rose.  Good detail on the veins in the brown area, though focus could have been sharper.</td>', 'Dried florals are wonderful subjects, but this one seems to need more color in it.  It isn''t the most attractive rendering of a dried rose.  Good detail on the veins in the brown area, though focus could have been sharper.', '2006-05-05 07:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384569, 328429, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image seems very digitized.  Not sure if it is because subject was far away and you tried to crop, but details are very dotted.  I used an Olympus D550z last year, and for some reason something happened in the file sizes and most of my images started coming out this way.  Luckily I was able to get a different camera.  Nothing can be done about the problem, though often the prints come out just fine.</td>', 'Image seems very digitized.  Not sure if it is because subject was far away and you tried to crop, but details are very dotted.  I used an Olympus D550z last year, and for some reason something happened in the file sizes and most of my images started coming out this way.  Luckily I was able to get a different camera.  Nothing can be done about the problem, though often the prints come out just fine.', '2006-05-05 07:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384574, 327768, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found subject to be uninteresting, though your leading lines give it some strength.  They aren''t leading anywhere, though, so when you use that as a compositional technique you need to have a point of reference where the lines are leading the eye.</td>', 'Found subject to be uninteresting, though your leading lines give it some strength.  They aren''t leading anywhere, though, so when you use that as a compositional technique you need to have a point of reference where the lines are leading the eye.', '2006-05-05 07:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384576, 327693, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Foreground is very dark, though.  You can adjust its exposure by extracting that part and increasing brightness, as well as doing a bit of dodging.  The other choice is to not have so much foreground, since its insertion into the composition (and at such a large amount0 should be better exposed.</td>', 'Nice sky.  Foreground is very dark, though.  You can adjust its exposure by extracting that part and increasing brightness, as well as doing a bit of dodging.  The other choice is to not have so much foreground, since its insertion into the composition (and at such a large amount0 should be better exposed.', '2006-05-05 07:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384581, 328394, 35602, '<td valign="top">Never been there.  The subject has been done so often though that this one doesn''t offer much.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a more dramtic sky.  The solid blue just doesn''t seem interesting enough.  The hillside seems to hold some interest, however.  I like the textures of the foliage, but there isn''t enough of it.</td>', 'Never been there.  The subject has been done so often though that this one doesn''t offer much.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a more dramtic sky.  The solid blue just doesn''t seem interesting enough.  The hillside seems to hold some interest, however.  I like the textures of the foliage, but there isn''t enough of it.', '2006-05-05 07:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384585, 327518, 35602, '<td valign="top">Snow is hard to get.  Unfortuneately the snow on the plants is lacking in detail.  Colors are very nice, though, and your detail on the flower heads is pretty good.</td>', 'Snow is hard to get.  Unfortuneately the snow on the plants is lacking in detail.  Colors are very nice, though, and your detail on the flower heads is pretty good.', '2006-05-05 07:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384590, 328531, 35602, '<td valign="top">The highlights are really overblown on the sky, the water, the sand,etc.  Birds are a nice touch.  That is probably my favorite part of the entire scene.</td>', 'The highlights are really overblown on the sky, the water, the sand,etc.  Birds are a nice touch.  That is probably my favorite part of the entire scene.', '2006-05-05 07:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384595, 327593, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very low contrast, which caused the image to appear a bit muddy.</td>', 'Very low contrast, which caused the image to appear a bit muddy.', '2006-05-05 07:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384596, 328233, 35602, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened.  The dof is pretty good, but could have even been more blurred out to create a background palette of green tones without detail.</td>', 'Looks oversharpened.  The dof is pretty good, but could have even been more blurred out to create a background palette of green tones without detail.', '2006-05-05 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384599, 328343, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really nice sky on this one.</td>', 'Really nice sky on this one.', '2006-05-05 07:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384602, 328381, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus on the ball.  Nice stop action.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus on the ball.  Nice stop action.', '2006-05-05 08:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384603, 328428, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel colors.  Focus is very uneven, though.  With multiple points of distance from the camera, it is hard to get a defined focal point.  Sometimes if you have a move function on the camera, you can adjust where the focus will be.</td>', 'Lovely pastel colors.  Focus is very uneven, though.  With multiple points of distance from the camera, it is hard to get a defined focal point.  Sometimes if you have a move function on the camera, you can adjust where the focus will be.', '2006-05-05 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384605, 328451, 35602, '<td valign="top">Almost took this one myself.  Very good definition of the constellation.</td>', 'Almost took this one myself.  Very good definition of the constellation.', '2006-05-05 08:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384606, 327933, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like the light on the grasses in the foreground.</td>', 'Like the light on the grasses in the foreground.', '2006-05-05 08:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384607, 328014, 35602, '<td valign="top">Angle isn''t the best on this one.  I think for shots like this you really do need to have faces in the subjects.  Clothing is  a good subject, especially period clothing, but on this image they are not the best highlighted part.  They appear to be secondary.</td>', 'Angle isn''t the best on this one.  I think for shots like this you really do need to have faces in the subjects.  Clothing is  a good subject, especially period clothing, but on this image they are not the best highlighted part.  They appear to be secondary.', '2006-05-05 08:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384609, 327665, 35602, '<td valign="top">Didn''t like the green treatment on this one.  Color correction caused the night sky to be blue, which is fine but it also really did  a number on the rest of the composition.</td>', 'Didn''t like the green treatment on this one.  Color correction caused the night sky to be blue, which is fine but it also really did  a number on the rest of the composition.', '2006-05-05 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384610, 327619, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems too out of focus.</td>', 'Seems too out of focus.', '2006-05-05 08:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384611, 327845, 35602, '<td valign="top">Focus should have been better to get clearer details on flower head.  The harsh light may have caused the details to get lost.  Digital cameras have a hard time reading light properly.  An earier time of day may have allowed that detail to really shine, rather than the light.</td>', 'Focus should have been better to get clearer details on flower head.  The harsh light may have caused the details to get lost.  Digital cameras have a hard time reading light properly.  An earier time of day may have allowed that detail to really shine, rather than the light.', '2006-05-05 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384613, 327817, 35602, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the skyline shot seems to be lacking in some way.  Night shots are great and I think everybody should try them, especially of cities.  Your detail is quite good, but maybe the cityline is too centered.  Can''t quite put my finger on it.</td>', 'For some reason, the skyline shot seems to be lacking in some way.  Night shots are great and I think everybody should try them, especially of cities.  Your detail is quite good, but maybe the cityline is too centered.  Can''t quite put my finger on it.', '2006-05-05 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
