(2385941, 328201, 46885, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more texture on the rose. From what I can see I can suspect some lack of sharpness on the dried petals. Some bounce such as tinfoil could help bring out the details.</td>', 'I''d like to see more texture on the rose. From what I can see I can suspect some lack of sharpness on the dried petals. Some bounce such as tinfoil could help bring out the details.', '2006-05-05 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385953, 327577, 46885, '<td valign="top">There''s some clash, imho: the perspective suggests that the train is moving towards us, its ''head'' is larger than tail. But the trails indicate that it was moving away from the camera, right? Call me conservative, but I''d like the two to coincide, not work against each other.</td>', 'There''s some clash, imho: the perspective suggests that the train is moving towards us, its ''head'' is larger than tail. But the trails indicate that it was moving away from the camera, right? Call me conservative, but I''d like the two to coincide, not work against each other.', '2006-05-05 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2385955, 327940, 46885, '<td valign="top">Great spearationi of whites. They came a wee bit magenta on my monitor, but that''s minor. I''d like to see a bit more of the vase.</td>', 'Great spearationi of whites. They came a wee bit magenta on my monitor, but that''s minor. I''d like to see a bit more of the vase.', '2006-05-05 20:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
