(2386386, 327774, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the eye and detail in the hair. I really like the falloff from light to dark on the right.  The light and dark areas are balance very well.<br/> <br/>However there seems to be a hot spont on the cheek.</td>', 'Great focus on the eye and detail in the hair. I really like the falloff from light to dark on the right.  The light and dark areas are balance very well. However there seems to be a hot spont on the cheek.', '2006-05-06 00:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
