(2386389, 327849, 70, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting but seems a bit overexposed. You''re unfortunately also hindered some by a really boring sky.</td>', 'Interesting lighting but seems a bit overexposed. You''re unfortunately also hindered some by a really boring sky.', '2006-05-06 00:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386391, 328148, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w conversion.</td>', 'Nice b/w conversion.', '2006-05-06 00:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386393, 328410, 70, '<td valign="top">Ack! Nicely done. Good clarity and catchlights in the eyes. Nice DOF. But eew on the title! :)</td>', 'Ack! Nicely done. Good clarity and catchlights in the eyes. Nice DOF. But eew on the title! :)', '2006-05-06 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386394, 327660, 70, '<td valign="top">The selective sepia doesn''t really do it for me here. I like the framing with the leaves but I think it''d be stronger if they were in focus as well.</td>', 'The selective sepia doesn''t really do it for me here. I like the framing with the leaves but I think it''d be stronger if they were in focus as well.', '2006-05-06 00:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386396, 327983, 70, '<td valign="top">Awww, beebees! Cute moment to catch. Unfortunately not an especially pleasing angle. Maybe a tighter crop would have helped as well.</td>', 'Awww, beebees! Cute moment to catch. Unfortunately not an especially pleasing angle. Maybe a tighter crop would have helped as well.', '2006-05-06 00:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386397, 327771, 10818, '<td valign="top">I bet if they had a beer instead of that water and sodas they would be much happier.<br/> <br/>I am kidding....its really a good photo, nice job.  Great work.</td>', 'I bet if they had a beer instead of that water and sodas they would be much happier. I am kidding....its really a good photo, nice job.  Great work.', '2006-05-06 00:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386401, 327891, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats cool, great capture.</td>', 'Thats cool, great capture.', '2006-05-06 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386402, 328463, 70, '<td valign="top">I think a better angle would have helped this shot. Perhaps moving back you could have gotten more of the E in State and less of the other sign. It''s a bit disconcerting to see portions of words and not be able to read them. The lighting is very nice on this, though.</td>', 'I think a better angle would have helped this shot. Perhaps moving back you could have gotten more of the E in State and less of the other sign. It''s a bit disconcerting to see portions of words and not be able to read them. The lighting is very nice on this, though.', '2006-05-06 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386407, 328002, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I love the floor. The stuff on the wall in the back is a little distracting...maybe you can remove that or just darken up that whole wall?</td>', 'Very cool shot. I love the floor. The stuff on the wall in the back is a little distracting...maybe you can remove that or just darken up that whole wall?', '2006-05-06 00:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386413, 328149, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Lighting seems a little off. I think maybe the whole thing is a little underexposed and perhaps the white balance is off some.</td>', 'Nice capture! Lighting seems a little off. I think maybe the whole thing is a little underexposed and perhaps the white balance is off some.', '2006-05-06 00:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386416, 327594, 70, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the colors and textures in this.</td>', 'Very cool. I love the colors and textures in this.', '2006-05-06 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
