(2386425, 328342, 70, '<td valign="top">B/W conversion could use a little more contrast here. Focus seems a bit off.</td>', 'B/W conversion could use a little more contrast here. Focus seems a bit off.', '2006-05-06 00:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386428, 328082, 55782, '<td valign="top">nice.  Looks like a painting.  very cool effect.</td>', 'nice.  Looks like a painting.  very cool effect.', '2006-05-06 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386432, 327517, 70, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve gotten a number of comments on the size so I really would recommend that you check out this tutorial on resizing for challenges. The extra pixels really make a difference!<br/> <br/>//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26<br/> <br/>Looks like a nice shot. Interesting lighting.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve gotten a number of comments on the size so I really would recommend that you check out this tutorial on resizing for challenges. The extra pixels really make a difference! //dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26 Looks like a nice shot. Interesting lighting.', '2006-05-06 00:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386433, 327847, 55782, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.  I love the yellow against the blue.</td>', 'nice perspective.  I love the yellow against the blue.', '2006-05-06 00:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386435, 327768, 55782, '<td valign="top">moody. a 9 from me.</td>', 'moody. a 9 from me.', '2006-05-06 00:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386436, 328499, 15204, '<td valign="top">I think some more midtone contrast in the water could make the waterfall really pop.  The image itself has good dynamic range, but somehow the water looks a bit flat.  That may have been the effect that you were going for, I realize.  Nice composotion.  I like how you shot at an angle instead of straight on and how you included the top of the arch in the frame.</td>', 'I think some more midtone contrast in the water could make the waterfall really pop.  The image itself has good dynamic range, but somehow the water looks a bit flat.  That may have been the effect that you were going for, I realize.  Nice composotion.  I like how you shot at an angle instead of straight on and how you included the top of the arch in the frame.', '2006-05-06 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386438, 328546, 55782, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo.  a 10!</td>', 'I love everything about this photo.  a 10!', '2006-05-06 00:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386441, 327546, 55782, '<td valign="top">funny,... a little creepy!</td>', 'funny,... a little creepy!', '2006-05-06 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2386448, 328537, 55782, '<td valign="top">I find the rope a bit distracting.  I see what you were going for, but it doesn''t quite work for me.  It''s almost like two seperate photos put together.</td>', 'I find the rope a bit distracting.  I see what you were going for, but it doesn''t quite work for me.  It''s almost like two seperate photos put together.', '2006-05-06 00:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
