(2386509, 328321, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Smile is perfect. I wish there were some kind of way to add more "contrast" between her skin tone and the pews. I know this is almost an impossible request...!</td>', 'Very nice shot. Smile is perfect. I wish there were some kind of way to add more "contrast" between her skin tone and the pews. I know this is almost an impossible request...!', '2006-05-06 00:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
