(2386979, 328148, 49930, '<td valign="top">Great concept - flying glasses. The shine on the glasses contrasts well with the cloud background. Framing draws your eye into the picture. Well done -a great shot and great editoring.</td>', 'Great concept - flying glasses. The shine on the glasses contrasts well with the cloud background. Framing draws your eye into the picture. Well done -a great shot and great editoring.', '2006-05-06 06:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
