(2386987, 328487, 49930, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky. Colour satuation good but its a bit busy with all the grass at the front. I think it would have worked better if there was less stalks (on the left)- which would make the object stand out a little more. A great shot though.</td>', 'Lovely sky. Colour satuation good but its a bit busy with all the grass at the front. I think it would have worked better if there was less stalks (on the left)- which would make the object stand out a little more. A great shot though.', '2006-05-06 06:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
