(2387095, 327615, 30049, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you managed to line up (and keep them there) the ladybugs - nor do I care.  It''s a fantastic image!<br/> <br/>Nice color, well focused, attention to composition details...great job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t know how you managed to line up (and keep them there) the ladybugs - nor do I care.  It''s a fantastic image! Nice color, well focused, attention to composition details...great job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-05-06 08:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
