(2387220, 328286, 37730, '<td valign="top">IMO this type of photography is one of the hardest.  To get everything right must be a big challenge.  It would seem to me that flaws are magnified when such precision is required.  You have done a nice job here.  The design and colour choice IMO works great.  There seems to be a few line which are not as crisp as they could be but that could possibly be my monitor or just my eyes.  Well done.</td>', 'IMO this type of photography is one of the hardest.  To get everything right must be a big challenge.  It would seem to me that flaws are magnified when such precision is required.  You have done a nice job here.  The design and colour choice IMO works great.  There seems to be a few line which are not as crisp as they could be but that could possibly be my monitor or just my eyes.  Well done.', '2006-05-06 10:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387237, 328286, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Super strong lines and bold colors really make this pop off the screen.  The liquid sloshing to the right really gives this shot lots of visual interest.  I do see a teensy bit of a break in the black circle within the wine glass reflection which makes me wonder about cloning, but it didn''t affect the score because I had to study the image to find it and I''m not positive it''s a PP mistake.  Very nice job!</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Super strong lines and bold colors really make this pop off the screen.  The liquid sloshing to the right really gives this shot lots of visual interest.  I do see a teensy bit of a break in the black circle within the wine glass reflection which makes me wonder about cloning, but it didn''t affect the score because I had to study the image to find it and I''m not positive it''s a PP mistake.  Very nice job!', '2006-05-06 10:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387238, 328006, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  DOF is excellent and makes this shot.  Composition is very strong, and this image has tons of depth.  Black and white was a good choice.  Overall, a very good image that should do very well.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Returning for comment.  DOF is excellent and makes this shot.  Composition is very strong, and this image has tons of depth.  Black and white was a good choice.  Overall, a very good image that should do very well.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-05-06 10:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
