(2389579, 327615, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro capture and nice addition of the lady bugs.  Your focus is crystal clear here and the composition is good, too.  I''d like to see a deeper blue on the background for this one, as it would really serve to make the yellow in the flower pop.  I think a small curves adjustment would have served to do just that.</td>', 'Very nice macro capture and nice addition of the lady bugs.  Your focus is crystal clear here and the composition is good, too.  I''d like to see a deeper blue on the background for this one, as it would really serve to make the yellow in the flower pop.  I think a small curves adjustment would have served to do just that.', '2006-05-07 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
