(2389855, 328320, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the grit on the hands showing the texture of the palms and the detail in the ropes. Nice study of hands...well posed for the image. The one thing that detracts from the sucess of this image is the forearm in the upper left corner...if the lighting were dimmer there to help it recede into the background, I think it would be better...it''s curve and pale cleanliness detract from the strength of the working hands.</td>', 'I like the grit on the hands showing the texture of the palms and the detail in the ropes. Nice study of hands...well posed for the image. The one thing that detracts from the sucess of this image is the forearm in the upper left corner...if the lighting were dimmer there to help it recede into the background, I think it would be better...it''s curve and pale cleanliness detract from the strength of the working hands.', '2006-05-07 12:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
