(2389862, 327692, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a neat silhouette! I like the yellow and black--gives it a great graphic concept. The one pelican to the extreme right doesn''t add anything and kind of pulls the eye out of the composition. Wish there were more emphasis on the "two-headed" pelican...slight cropping would strengthen this composition, in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a neat silhouette! I like the yellow and black--gives it a great graphic concept. The one pelican to the extreme right doesn''t add anything and kind of pulls the eye out of the composition. Wish there were more emphasis on the "two-headed" pelican...slight cropping would strengthen this composition, in my opinion.', '2006-05-07 12:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
