(2390320, 328226, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cute title. Looks like a fun moment for a pose. Wish you could have gotten just a bit higher and to the left to help minimize background distractions (and possibly hide that unappealing water bottle).</td>', 'Cute title. Looks like a fun moment for a pose. Wish you could have gotten just a bit higher and to the left to help minimize background distractions (and possibly hide that unappealing water bottle).', '2006-05-07 17:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390325, 328499, 6172, '<td valign="top">This appears tilted to the right to me.</td>', 'This appears tilted to the right to me.', '2006-05-07 17:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390327, 327915, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great subject! The selective desaturation feels forced a bit...no doubt in an attempt to get rid of background distractions...just not really working so perfectly. For me, it''s an "almost."</td>', 'Great subject! The selective desaturation feels forced a bit...no doubt in an attempt to get rid of background distractions...just not really working so perfectly. For me, it''s an "almost."', '2006-05-07 17:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390335, 328179, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and mood of this image. The colors are so pleasing to look at! The one thing I think would help this most is cropping a bit of the dark space from the left and up a little from the bottom. I think the space on the left adds little and cropping might place the subject a bit better. The contrasty ribbing on the bottom seems to demand undue attention as well.</td>', 'I like the softness and mood of this image. The colors are so pleasing to look at! The one thing I think would help this most is cropping a bit of the dark space from the left and up a little from the bottom. I think the space on the left adds little and cropping might place the subject a bit better. The contrasty ribbing on the bottom seems to demand undue attention as well.', '2006-05-07 17:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390336, 328238, 6172, '<td valign="top">Is that why everyone around seems amused?</td>', 'Is that why everyone around seems amused?', '2006-05-07 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390343, 328060, 16488, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m just a sucker for palm trees at sunset...but as common as they are they aren''t usually as successful as this one. Love the silhouette against the perfectly orange sky! Nice!</td>', 'I guess I''m just a sucker for palm trees at sunset...but as common as they are they aren''t usually as successful as this one. Love the silhouette against the perfectly orange sky! Nice!', '2006-05-07 17:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390353, 327505, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lens flare...I think it adds the right kind of impact to the photo. It might be a bit too much as it begins to overpower the lovely silhouette. Skyline being uneven adds a minor distraction...wonder if this was taken a little more to the left and slightly lower if the shapes would have been better separated....</td>', 'Interesting use of lens flare...I think it adds the right kind of impact to the photo. It might be a bit too much as it begins to overpower the lovely silhouette. Skyline being uneven adds a minor distraction...wonder if this was taken a little more to the left and slightly lower if the shapes would have been better separated....', '2006-05-07 17:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390358, 328082, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract! I like the strong colors in the water...almost like an oil slick. Think perhaps the neon orange (on the left) might be a bi heavy on the saturation...it''s feels like it draws undue attention.</td>', 'Interesting abstract! I like the strong colors in the water...almost like an oil slick. Think perhaps the neon orange (on the left) might be a bi heavy on the saturation...it''s feels like it draws undue attention.', '2006-05-07 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390360, 327776, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is sweet! I like the motion of water droplets and the way you singled out the one iris (blue flag?). Two elements detract from the whole: The one background flower at the left of the frame competes with the sharp one infront of it...if it were in shadow as much as the one at far right there would be better separation of the subject; the other detractor is the orange line...it just takes so much attention by its color and placement in the composition. I think a little time in photoshop could fix these objections of mine.</td>', 'This is sweet! I like the motion of water droplets and the way you singled out the one iris (blue flag?). Two elements detract from the whole: The one background flower at the left of the frame competes with the sharp one infront of it...if it were in shadow as much as the one at far right there would be better separation of the subject; the other detractor is the orange line...it just takes so much attention by its color and placement in the composition. I think a little time in photoshop could fix these objections of mine.', '2006-05-07 17:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390375, 328553, 48576, '<td valign="top">great colour and shine - too bad about the backside...</td>', 'great colour and shine - too bad about the backside...', '2006-05-07 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390389, 327517, 16488, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice image here despite the small size. I like the way the horse breaks the lines of the fencing. Wide angle really conveys the straining for the grass. Nicely lit, well exposed, excellently seen!</td>', 'There''s a nice image here despite the small size. I like the way the horse breaks the lines of the fencing. Wide angle really conveys the straining for the grass. Nicely lit, well exposed, excellently seen!', '2006-05-07 17:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390394, 327915, 53964, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote, but wanted to comment...<br/>I loved the thumbnail but was a little disappointed when I clicked. She''s fantastic and I like the idea of the isolation but for my tastes you took it a bit too far. Now I get more of the impression that she''s posed in front a background instead of a part of the action, singled out. For me, it''s almost an incredible shot.</td>', 'Can''t vote, but wanted to comment...I loved the thumbnail but was a little disappointed when I clicked. She''s fantastic and I like the idea of the isolation but for my tastes you took it a bit too far. Now I get more of the impression that she''s posed in front a background instead of a part of the action, singled out. For me, it''s almost an incredible shot.', '2006-05-07 18:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
