(2391158, 328538, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very attractive subject but here i would have curbed my ambition to this most lovely face. The lighting, as is, robs a lot of important detail as it concentrates on the upper part and then it becomes too flat to complement the rest fo the figure. Hence, it makes the face charming at the cost of all else. Do not take this comment with its full weight but only an observation as to choices we all miss in similar images. Regardless, you get my 7 for this wonderful effort.</td>', 'A very attractive subject but here i would have curbed my ambition to this most lovely face. The lighting, as is, robs a lot of important detail as it concentrates on the upper part and then it becomes too flat to complement the rest fo the figure. Hence, it makes the face charming at the cost of all else. Do not take this comment with its full weight but only an observation as to choices we all miss in similar images. Regardless, you get my 7 for this wonderful effort.', '2006-05-07 22:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
