(2391530, 328492, 14620, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say thanks for all the helpful comments guys!  You are exactly right about the title, should have been "Hers".  The silly thing is I had another shot uploaded and at the very last second, literally, I changed to this one.  Here was the original submission:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=331444" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/331444.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/331444.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/14620/thumb/331444.jpg"/></a> <br/>It was title His and I think it fit more aptly to that photo.  But I was afraid I''d run out of time and didn''t have an idea of what to call the new photo so I left it.<br/> <br/>I also agree the the gaze is a little cold and unattached but I liked that about it, in that it seemed different from the normal "couple" shot.  I did prefer my original shot over this one, but again, I messed up with the aperture and the out of focus hand really bothered me. :(  Live and learn and thanks again! :)</td>', 'Just wanted to say thanks for all the helpful comments guys!  You are exactly right about the title, should have been "Hers".  The silly thing is I had another shot uploaded and at the very last second, literally, I changed to this one.  Here was the original submission: It was title His and I think it fit more aptly to that photo.  But I was afraid I''d run out of time and didn''t have an idea of what to call the new photo so I left it. I also agree the the gaze is a little cold and unattached but I liked that about it, in that it seemed different from the normal "couple" shot.  I did prefer my original shot over this one, but again, I messed up with the aperture and the out of focus hand really bothered me. :(  Live and learn and thanks again! :)', '2006-05-08 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391532, 328195, 37893, '<td valign="top">I knew it. Hey wanna give some of us a chance to ribbon :P Great job Gary. I knew this was yours ;)</td>', 'I knew it. Hey wanna give some of us a chance to ribbon :P Great job Gary. I knew this was yours ;)', '2006-05-08 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
