(2391616, 328238, 36065, '<td valign="top">Powerful capture!  I understand the title, and it absolutely adds to the tug of the image.  Often times I will ignore the title, overlooking it completely.  Initially looking at the image, I thought that it was nicely focused and well-exposed shot.  Reading the title stopped me in my tracks.  This one definitely evokes a rush of emotion no matter where you stand.  I think the composition and your score would have been greatly improved if you''d not chopped off that right hand, and opened up that aperture some to really set him off from the background.  Well seen and great titling.</td>', 'Powerful capture!  I understand the title, and it absolutely adds to the tug of the image.  Often times I will ignore the title, overlooking it completely.  Initially looking at the image, I thought that it was nicely focused and well-exposed shot.  Reading the title stopped me in my tracks.  This one definitely evokes a rush of emotion no matter where you stand.  I think the composition and your score would have been greatly improved if you''d not chopped off that right hand, and opened up that aperture some to really set him off from the background.  Well seen and great titling.', '2006-05-08 01:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
