(2391777, 327849, 38496, '<td valign="top">This isn''t as good as some of your other shots, but it''s not bad.<br/>The lighting on the rock in the forground is actually really cool, and I like the way the greenery in the cracks contrasts with the red.  What holds this back, I think, is the background.  It seems over exposed, and just sort of ''blah''. It does make a nice contrast to the foreground though.  Maybe if you could have arranged for some blue sky that day Ü.</td>', 'This isn''t as good as some of your other shots, but it''s not bad.The lighting on the rock in the forground is actually really cool, and I like the way the greenery in the cracks contrasts with the red.  What holds this back, I think, is the background.  It seems over exposed, and just sort of ''blah''. It does make a nice contrast to the foreground though.  Maybe if you could have arranged for some blue sky that day Ü.', '2006-05-08 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
