(2392797, 328472, 57886, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Is she <i>still</i> your girlfriend? ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well, I hope she still is :o) We had fun, although it was raining and midnight (which scared us a bit - walking in the small woods, it was very scary)</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Is she still your girlfriend? ;-)  Well, I hope she still is :o) We had fun, although it was raining and midnight (which scared us a bit - walking in the small woods, it was very scary)', '2006-05-08 10:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
