(2392815, 327768, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t do better. I guess people are sick of night-time slow-shutter headlight shots, but this was executed very well. You got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t do better. I guess people are sick of night-time slow-shutter headlight shots, but this was executed very well. You got a 7 from me.', '2006-05-08 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392816, 327615, 3569, '<td valign="top">Hey Doc,<br/> <br/>You did much better than I thought this shot would do.  Glad you got the ribbon.  I guess this nit-picking biologist was too in-the-box.  Van</td>', 'Hey Doc, You did much better than I thought this shot would do.  Glad you got the ribbon.  I guess this nit-picking biologist was too in-the-box.  Van', '2006-05-08 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392823, 328088, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, great composition. I think it didn''t score better because people at DPC tend to like subjects that pop out. This subject blends beautifully into its surroundings, creating a flat, abstract effect that is vital and artistic and beautiful and that DPCers just never seem to get.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, great composition. I think it didn''t score better because people at DPC tend to like subjects that pop out. This subject blends beautifully into its surroundings, creating a flat, abstract effect that is vital and artistic and beautiful and that DPCers just never seem to get.', '2006-05-08 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392831, 328300, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great lines in this image.  Congratulations on a well deserved high score.</td>', 'Great lines in this image.  Congratulations on a well deserved high score.', '2006-05-08 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392840, 327594, 49652, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon.  This is just beautiful.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon.  This is just beautiful.', '2006-05-08 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392851, 327615, 44611, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  This was the only image I gave a 10 to in this challenge - it definitely deserved it.</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  This was the only image I gave a 10 to in this challenge - it definitely deserved it.', '2006-05-08 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392865, 328389, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Interesting arrangement of foreground aligns well with the strong vertical lines of the fence. This was underscored, probably due to a prejudice against natural lighting and soft focus (the "70s" look! :) ).</td>', 'Great composition. Interesting arrangement of foreground aligns well with the strong vertical lines of the fence. This was underscored, probably due to a prejudice against natural lighting and soft focus (the "70s" look! :) ).', '2006-05-08 10:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392876, 327848, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading Post...<br/>  The colors are very vibrant and the dirt road makes me think of a relaxing day in the country. The centered road and slightly soft focus are probably why it wasn''t voted higher. I tend to do the same. Maybe it could benefit from some sharpening and using the full 640 pixel size for detail.</td>', 'Trading Post...  The colors are very vibrant and the dirt road makes me think of a relaxing day in the country. The centered road and slightly soft focus are probably why it wasn''t voted higher. I tend to do the same. Maybe it could benefit from some sharpening and using the full 640 pixel size for detail.', '2006-05-08 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392902, 327505, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think the lens flare brings added drama.  Under-appreciated shot.  Nice work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-08 09:59:15.</i></td>', 'I think the lens flare brings added drama.  Under-appreciated shot.  Nice work.', '2006-05-08 10:58:56.000000', '2006-05-08 10:59:15.000000', 0),
(2392937, 327788, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Robbed.  I do not recommend looking at the shots that beat you to learn anything; it will just piss you off or make you laugh.  DPC is really getting on my nerves.</td>', 'Wow.  Robbed.  I do not recommend looking at the shots that beat you to learn anything; it will just piss you off or make you laugh.  DPC is really getting on my nerves.', '2006-05-08 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392944, 328411, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I liked this. It''s an appealing visual. The shadow play is very nice and consistent. The texture of the post and wall show through very nicely as well. It''s the type picture I see hanging in office buildings everywhere. Maybe you should market it!</td>', 'Trading post...  I liked this. It''s an appealing visual. The shadow play is very nice and consistent. The texture of the post and wall show through very nicely as well. It''s the type picture I see hanging in office buildings everywhere. Maybe you should market it!', '2006-05-08 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392947, 327863, 20530, '<td valign="top">What a shame that DPCrs couldn''t appreciate this image more. Look at the score you got from commenters and ignore the other! I really liked it and gave it an 8.</td>', 'What a shame that DPCrs couldn''t appreciate this image more. Look at the score you got from commenters and ignore the other! I really liked it and gave it an 8.', '2006-05-08 11:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392963, 328474, 20530, '<td valign="top">I think this deserved better. I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I think this deserved better. I gave it an 8.', '2006-05-08 11:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392969, 328534, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading post -<br/>I was one of the masses that gave this a 5. This is a tough one to critique (or maybe easy). The technical aspects of the shot seem to be fine. Good focus. The lighting is nice and the shadows underneath soft. But it doesnt really hold much interest to me. Straightforward shot of a model plane. I probably didn''t spend much time looking at it while voting because it didn''t have anything that screamed out at me "Look at me". The 1s,2s and 3s are a bit harsh I think because of the technical aspects being there, but the shot didn''t leave me with any feeling or emotion. Just the fact that I looked at a model plane.</td>', 'Trading post -I was one of the masses that gave this a 5. This is a tough one to critique (or maybe easy). The technical aspects of the shot seem to be fine. Good focus. The lighting is nice and the shadows underneath soft. But it doesnt really hold much interest to me. Straightforward shot of a model plane. I probably didn''t spend much time looking at it while voting because it didn''t have anything that screamed out at me "Look at me". The 1s,2s and 3s are a bit harsh I think because of the technical aspects being there, but the shot didn''t leave me with any feeling or emotion. Just the fact that I looked at a model plane.', '2006-05-08 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392982, 328534, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Reminds me of a catalog photo. This wouldn''t hold my interest much except as an advertisment for a collectable. My husband''s a big Nascar fan, me not so much. Technically for this type of image I don''t think you''re supposed to have shadows. The crop works well. Overall, a good commercial image.</td>', 'Trading post...   Reminds me of a catalog photo. This wouldn''t hold my interest much except as an advertisment for a collectable. My husband''s a big Nascar fan, me not so much. Technically for this type of image I don''t think you''re supposed to have shadows. The crop works well. Overall, a good commercial image.', '2006-05-08 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393023, 328017, 19672, '<td valign="top">That had to be fun.....<br/> <br/>Great fun shot...</td>', 'That had to be fun..... Great fun shot...', '2006-05-08 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393029, 328207, 35739, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ladymonarda:</b></div><hr/><i> The glare of the sun kind of overpowers the plane on this one.  It also was very dark, making the plane even harder to see.  I get the idea that this may have been shot during the day but the extreme underexposure is what caused you to create the title that you did. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree with Ladymonarda on this.</td>', 'Originally posted by ladymonarda: The glare of the sun kind of overpowers the plane on this one.  It also was very dark, making the plane even harder to see.  I get the idea that this may have been shot during the day but the extreme underexposure is what caused you to create the title that you did.   I agree with Ladymonarda on this.', '2006-05-08 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393033, 327768, 4517, '<td valign="top">You picked a good time to shoot with still some colour in the sky but the main problem is there is not enough going on. No streetlights and not many cars.</td>', 'You picked a good time to shoot with still some colour in the sky but the main problem is there is not enough going on. No streetlights and not many cars.', '2006-05-08 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393036, 327768, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea, wrong time of day to take this photo if you want my opinion.  What I mean is that you have no texture to the dark ground around the freeway and that freeway itself isn´t enough to carry the picture.  I would suggest you being there an hour or half an hour earlier to be able to catch some texture in the dark areas of this photo.<br/> <br/>The composition is good, nothing wrong with that department.</td>', 'Good idea, wrong time of day to take this photo if you want my opinion.  What I mean is that you have no texture to the dark ground around the freeway and that freeway itself isn´t enough to carry the picture.  I would suggest you being there an hour or half an hour earlier to be able to catch some texture in the dark areas of this photo. The composition is good, nothing wrong with that department.', '2006-05-08 11:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393039, 328232, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Colette.  Sorry about the score, it''s kind of typical DPC voting!<br/> <br/>I wonder if this is a crop?  I''d like to see a little more on the right.</td>', 'Beautiful Colette.  Sorry about the score, it''s kind of typical DPC voting! I wonder if this is a crop?  I''d like to see a little more on the right.', '2006-05-08 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
