(2393116, 327768, 23394, '<td valign="top">it''s a great idea, and you''ve gotten some good tips.  these shots are difficult because there is so little that you can control (well, short of dropping stuff to make cars swerve).<br/> <br/>you have to close your eyes and imagine what you''re after, set it up shoot, then examine and make adjustments.  if you aren''t feeling ''wow'', then go look somewhere else.<br/> <br/>one of the keys to making this shot is the capturing the dynamics.  here are a couple (although mine is nowhere near as good as mark''s shot).<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=54542" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/176/thumb/54542.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/176/thumb/54542.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/176/thumb/54542.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=232244" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/378/thumb/232244.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/378/thumb/232244.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/378/thumb/232244.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-08 15:00:21.</i></td>', 'it''s a great idea, and you''ve gotten some good tips.  these shots are difficult because there is so little that you can control (well, short of dropping stuff to make cars swerve). you have to close your eyes and imagine what you''re after, set it up shoot, then examine and make adjustments.  if you aren''t feeling ''wow'', then go look somewhere else. one of the keys to making this shot is the capturing the dynamics.  here are a couple (although mine is nowhere near as good as mark''s shot).  ', '2006-05-08 12:06:54.000000', '2006-05-08 16:00:21.000000', 0),
