(2393300, 327761, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/>I gave a 4 on this one. The colors are a bit flat. The position of the llamas head would have been better if cocked down looking at the camera a bit. A position where you may think he is looking at who he is going to spit at (which would have been you). More of a protrait pose (if you can get a llama to pose for a portrait - lol) would have helped. Also the trees are a distraction. A solid sky background would have been very nice, especially with him being off centered. Selective saturation on him would have made him stand out a bit better as well.</td>', 'Trading Post - I gave a 4 on this one. The colors are a bit flat. The position of the llamas head would have been better if cocked down looking at the camera a bit. A position where you may think he is looking at who he is going to spit at (which would have been you). More of a protrait pose (if you can get a llama to pose for a portrait - lol) would have helped. Also the trees are a distraction. A solid sky background would have been very nice, especially with him being off centered. Selective saturation on him would have made him stand out a bit better as well.', '2006-05-08 13:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393302, 328546, 36060, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2006-05-08 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393347, 328300, 41746, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your yet another superb image from Kleifarvatn. I like the strong and impressive lines in the ground and the sky with the rock in the water perfectly fit to make an excellent composition. The lightning is lovely. I gave 10.</td>', 'Congrats on your yet another superb image from Kleifarvatn. I like the strong and impressive lines in the ground and the sky with the rock in the water perfectly fit to make an excellent composition. The lightning is lovely. I gave 10.', '2006-05-08 13:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393352, 327848, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>It seems like alot of the fine details are lost in this pic - probably due to resizing. Everything seems a bit too blurry. The colors are ok, though on my monitor there seems to be a slight odd cast to it all. I am not quite sure what the focus of the shot is. Is it the path or maybe the red and white buds? Just not enough detail for either to stand out in an eye catching way. A hidden treat would have been nice - such as maybe a deer at the end of the path peeking out in the trees. Somehting that would have been a fun find. I realize that you probably dont have a deer at your disposal, but something clear to focus on would have helped. (Sorry for the ramble).</td>', 'Trading Post -It seems like alot of the fine details are lost in this pic - probably due to resizing. Everything seems a bit too blurry. The colors are ok, though on my monitor there seems to be a slight odd cast to it all. I am not quite sure what the focus of the shot is. Is it the path or maybe the red and white buds? Just not enough detail for either to stand out in an eye catching way. A hidden treat would have been nice - such as maybe a deer at the end of the path peeking out in the trees. Somehting that would have been a fun find. I realize that you probably dont have a deer at your disposal, but something clear to focus on would have helped. (Sorry for the ramble).', '2006-05-08 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393391, 327594, 21915, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your votes and the great comments.<br/>Graham, somewhere on cloud 9 :)</td>', 'Thanks for all your votes and the great comments.Graham, somewhere on cloud 9 :)', '2006-05-08 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393431, 328411, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/> <br/>Nice shot overall. Good lines, curves, shadows and focus. Interest level for me was a bit lower. Even though from a technical standpoint (as far as I am able to judge technical aspects of pictures) this works well, the image itself doesn''t scream "Look at me!!!". <br/>Edit - Looking back at your top challenge entries I am really glad that this didnt do a tad bit better. I think your teapot shot is far superior and wouldnt like to see that one replaced with this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-08 12:42:54.</i></td>', 'Trading Post -  Nice shot overall. Good lines, curves, shadows and focus. Interest level for me was a bit lower. Even though from a technical standpoint (as far as I am able to judge technical aspects of pictures) this works well, the image itself doesn''t scream "Look at me!!!". Edit - Looking back at your top challenge entries I am really glad that this didnt do a tad bit better. I think your teapot shot is far superior and wouldnt like to see that one replaced with this one.', '2006-05-08 13:41:24.000000', '2006-05-08 13:42:54.000000', 0),
