(2393553, 328232, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that this one suffered from the focus not being crystal clear.  While we can make out the head of the ant inside the flower, everything looks blurred to me.  These types of shots don''t typically do well on this site.  Also, bringing the ants position to the left would have helped out your composition some by bring the the center of the flower more into the frame.  Great eye to see such a scene, just not the best of all execution.  Notice with your high scoring photographs that your focus is crisp and they have a great contrast of colors.</td>', 'I think that this one suffered from the focus not being crystal clear.  While we can make out the head of the ant inside the flower, everything looks blurred to me.  These types of shots don''t typically do well on this site.  Also, bringing the ants position to the left would have helped out your composition some by bring the the center of the flower more into the frame.  Great eye to see such a scene, just not the best of all execution.  Notice with your high scoring photographs that your focus is crisp and they have a great contrast of colors.', '2006-05-08 14:05:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393606, 327692, 49652, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The colors and silhouettes are great.  It was one of my favorites in a challenge full of great photos.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The colors and silhouettes are great.  It was one of my favorites in a challenge full of great photos.', '2006-05-08 14:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
