(2394061, 327915, 42125, '<td valign="top">Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)<br/>The model is gorgious and you captured her very well.<br/>What is good in the picture?:<br/>1. Lovely colours, you must have edited in that way the other persons are in another colour space or something like that. Enough for my speculations on that but it fits the picture well.<br/>2. Lighting on main subject mostly good.<br/>3. Good focus and contrasts.<br/>What IMO could be better?:<br/>1. The cropping, crop about 6-10mm from the right side.<br/>2. Frame is a bit big and makes again the black space in the right a bit to big.<br/>3. Light on nose on main subject a bit harsh.<br/>Other than that great and a well deserved Top 20 finish.<br/>Congratulations! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-10 20:26:04.</i></td>', 'Comment from a member of your own commenting club :-)The model is gorgious and you captured her very well.What is good in the picture?:1. Lovely colours, you must have edited in that way the other persons are in another colour space or something like that. Enough for my speculations on that but it fits the picture well.2. Lighting on main subject mostly good.3. Good focus and contrasts.What IMO could be better?:1. The cropping, crop about 6-10mm from the right side.2. Frame is a bit big and makes again the black space in the right a bit to big.3. Light on nose on main subject a bit harsh.Other than that great and a well deserved Top 20 finish.Congratulations! :-)', '2006-05-08 16:29:07.000000', '2006-05-10 21:26:04.000000', 0),
