(2411417, 328195, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m late on my rounds. This is gorgeous. I do SO wish I could libve where such majestic, monumental religious architecture abounds. On Cape Cod there is no such thing as a meeting-place of grandeur. These were simple people and they built simply.<br/> <br/>I love Cathedrals etc, can you tell? Been in dozens and dozens of ''em :-)<br/> <br/>Great capture! I love it.</td>', 'I''m late on my rounds. This is gorgeous. I do SO wish I could libve where such majestic, monumental religious architecture abounds. On Cape Cod there is no such thing as a meeting-place of grandeur. These were simple people and they built simply. I love Cathedrals etc, can you tell? Been in dozens and dozens of ''em :-) Great capture! I love it.', '2006-05-13 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
