(2434863, 328191, 50674, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one was yours. I also scored a PB in that same challenge, one more thing in common.<br/>I thought this was very good in the challenge. The colours are sublime and the composition excellent. There is a softness to it that almost makes me like that little creature, and in real life, I can''t stand them.<br/>I didn''t comment on it in the challenge as I am trying to comment on the ones I think are not so good, I think those photographers maybe need the encouragement more. But I gave it a 7.<br/>And so nice you thank Konador, he is the reason for me being here (he does not know that). I stumbled upon his blog and saw that he mentioned something called DPChallenge, and here I am.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-19 09:19:32.</i></td>', 'Wow, this one was yours. I also scored a PB in that same challenge, one more thing in common.I thought this was very good in the challenge. The colours are sublime and the composition excellent. There is a softness to it that almost makes me like that little creature, and in real life, I can''t stand them.I didn''t comment on it in the challenge as I am trying to comment on the ones I think are not so good, I think those photographers maybe need the encouragement more. But I gave it a 7.And so nice you thank Konador, he is the reason for me being here (he does not know that). I stumbled upon his blog and saw that he mentioned something called DPChallenge, and here I am.', '2006-05-19 10:17:31.000000', '2006-05-19 10:19:32.000000', 0),
