(2856475, 327788, 43031, '<td valign="top">The statements here are amazing. The metal grating: trapped, held back, forgotten. The glass: brokeness, fragility, lost emotion (opaqued by dirt and grime). And the boy, covered in his environment, half lost to the darkness, shadowed and worn beyond his years, his only hope and brightness lies behind his eyes. Not enough left to even reach out throught he grate with dirtied hands, only enough hope to stare and hope someone sees him. Someone notices him. That someone would care enough to set him free from the prison he has made.<br/> <br/>Oh, so many memories. I am so glad that this is no longer me. But it still is a part of who I am today. It still makes me cry, because I always feel like I''m still that child, and have to remember who I have become.</td>', 'The statements here are amazing. The metal grating: trapped, held back, forgotten. The glass: brokeness, fragility, lost emotion (opaqued by dirt and grime). And the boy, covered in his environment, half lost to the darkness, shadowed and worn beyond his years, his only hope and brightness lies behind his eyes. Not enough left to even reach out throught he grate with dirtied hands, only enough hope to stare and hope someone sees him. Someone notices him. That someone would care enough to set him free from the prison he has made. Oh, so many memories. I am so glad that this is no longer me. But it still is a part of who I am today. It still makes me cry, because I always feel like I''m still that child, and have to remember who I have become.', '2006-09-22 11:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2861793, 328487, 25678, '<td valign="top">I just found this picture (I feel so lame)  Absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'I just found this picture (I feel so lame)  Absolutely wonderful!', '2006-09-25 00:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
