(4834447, 327940, 46097, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, about the pink colour cast, which I had not realised at the time.<br/> <br/>This was due to a red sweater, I had been wearing, at the time I shot this......reflection was enough to give a light pink colour cast!<br/>I''ll be more careful next time, and wear something lighter, or stand back more.</td>', 'Very interesting, about the pink colour cast, which I had not realised at the time. This was due to a red sweater, I had been wearing, at the time I shot this......reflection was enough to give a light pink colour cast!I''ll be more careful next time, and wear something lighter, or stand back more.', '2008-07-19 21:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4926899, 327614, 69008, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, and with the right lens to get things into perspective. I think the palm fits well with the feathers in this and adds a lot in the way of interplay between the tree and the bird. The white sky is nice too.</td>', 'Excellent shot, and with the right lens to get things into perspective. I think the palm fits well with the feathers in this and adds a lot in the way of interplay between the tree and the bird. The white sky is nice too.', '2008-09-01 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
